<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">RRK09.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 SAMUELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Samueli Eky'okubanza</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">EKITABO KYA SAMUELI</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKY'OKUBANZA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Hanna okushaba omwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 6:27">1 Bus 6:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakaba hariho omushaija owa Ramasaimu-zofimu omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, eiziina rye Elukaana, mwene Yerohaamu, mwijukuru wa Elihu, mwene Tobu ya Zuufi, Omuefuraimu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Akaba aine abakazi babiri, omwe naayetwa Hanna, n'ondiijo Penina; Penina akaba naazaara, kwonka Hanna ari engumba.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 18:1">Yos 18:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ogwo akaba aruga omu rurembo rw'owaabo buri mwaka, ainamuka Shiilo kuramizayo MUKAMA ow'amahe n'okumutambira ebitambo. Kandi beene Eli bombi, Hofuni na Finehaasi, niyo baabaire nibakora omurimo gwa MUKAMA ogw'obunyamurwa. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Aha izooba eri Elukaana yaabaire atambiraho ebitambo, akaba agira emigabo, agiha Penina omukazi we n'abaana be b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki, <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:2">Kut 30:2</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Hanna amuha emigabo ebiri, ahabw'okuba akaba naamukunda, n'obu MUKAMA yaabaire amwimire oruzaaro. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Kandi muka iba akaba amuteerera enaku, ngu amugwise kubi, ahakuba MUKAMA akaba amwimire oruzaaro. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:14">Kur 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:41">Luk 2:41</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo byabaire biba buri mwaka; Hanna ku yaabaire aza omu nju ya MUKAMA, muka iba amuteerera enaku. Ekyo kimuriza, ayanga n'okurya. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:15">Rus 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Elukaana iba akaba amubuuza ati: Beitu shi, Hanna, orizibwa ki? N'enki ekikuzibira kurya? Ahabw'enki omutima gwawe gutuura n'amaganya? Tindikukukirira abaana b'aboojo ikumi?<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Eizooba rimwe ku baaherize kurya n'okunywa, Hanna yaimuka ahu baabaire bari omuri Shiilo. Obwo Eli omunyamurwa akaba ashutami aha kitebe kye aha kiti ky'omuryango gwa hekalu ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hanna yaatandika kushaba MUKAMA, aine obusaasi bwingi omu mutima, naarira munonga; <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:3">Kub 30:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:32">Kut 29:32</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 6:5">Kub 6:5</ref>. </char></note> yaaragaanisa naahiga omu maisho ga MUKAMA, naagira ati: Ai MUKAMA ow'amahe, ku oraareebe okubonabona kw'omuzaana waawe, waanyijuka, otaanyebwa, wampa omwana w'omwojo, ndyamukuhongyera, abe owaawe ebiro byona ebi arimara omu nsi, kandi orumweiso tirurimuraba ha mutwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Ku yaagumiizemu naashaba atyo omu maisho ga MUKAMA, Eli yaaguma naamureeba aha minwa. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Kwonka Hanna we akaba naashabira aha mutima, eminwa ye neimuka, eiraka rye ritarikuhurirwa; nikyo Eli yaateekateekyeire ngu asinzire. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Eli nikwo kumubuuza ati: Oryahitsya hi n'esindo? Ku ocwa viinyo? <verse eid="1SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:8">Zab 62:8</ref>. </char></note> Hanna yaamugarukamu ati: Tikwo kiri, Mukama wangye; ndi omukazi oine omutima gw'obusaasi; tiinyweire viinyo nari ekirikusinza kyona, kureka ninshuka amaganya g'omu mutima gwangye omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Otateekateeka ngu omuzaana waawe n'ekifa-mutima; ahakuba ebi naaba ningamba n'okuhitsya hati, mbireeteirwe amaganya maingi n'okugwisibwa kubi. <verse eid="1SA 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:48">Luk 8:48</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 20:4">Zab 20:4</ref>. </char></note> Eli yaamugira ati: Yegyendere n'obusingye; MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli akuhe eki waamushaba. <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:24">Yoh 16:24</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaagira ati: Omuzaana waawe agirirwe embabazi omu maisho gaawe. Atyo ogwo mukazi yaayegyendera yaarya, tiyaagaruka kureebwa aine enaku.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Samueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 30:22">Kut 30:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baimuka kare omu kasheeshe, baaza omu maisho ga MUKAMA, baaramya; bwanyima baagarukayo, baataaha omu ka yaabo Raama; ku baahikireyo, Elukaana yaamanya omukazi we Hanna, MUKAMA yaamwijuka. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Obunaku ku bwahikire, Hanna yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Samueli; ahakuba akagira ati: Nkamushaba MUKAMA.<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Bwanyima omushaija ogwo Elukaana yainamuka n'eka ye yoona kutambira MUKAMA ekitambo kya buri mwaka, kandi n'okuhikiiriza eki yaaraganiise; <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />kwonka Hanna tiyainamukayo; ahakuba akagira iba ati: Tindizayo, okuhitsya obu omwana aricuuka, nkabona kumutwara, nkamumurikira MUKAMA, akagumayo ebiro byona. <verse eid="1SA 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:7">Kub 30:7</ref>. </char></note> Iba Elukaana yaamugira ati: Kora eki orikusiima; otegyereze okuhitsya obu orimucuutsya; kwonka MUKAMA ahamye ekigambo kye. Atyo ogwo mukazi yaaguma aho naayontsya omwana we, okuhitsya obu yaamucuukize. <verse eid="1SA 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Ku yaaherize kumucuutsya, yaamwinamura n'enimi ishatu, na eefa emwe y'esaano y'obunono, n'efureebe ya viinyo; yaamutwara Shiilo omu nju ya MUKAMA; kandi ogwo mwana akaba akiri muto. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Batyo baita enimi, baareetera Eli omwana. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Ogwo mukazi yaagira ati: Mukama wangye, buzimazima nk'oku okiriho, niinye mukazi ori, owaabaire ayemereire aha omu maisho gaawe naashaba MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mat 7:7</ref>. </char></note> Omwana ogu nkamushaba MUKAMA; kandi agarukiremu okushaba kwangye; <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:11">1 Sam 2:11</ref>. </char></note> nikyo naamuhongyerera MUKAMA; ebiro byona ebi arimara omu nsi, aryaguma ahongyeirwe MUKAMA. Baaramizayo MUKAMA.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okusiima kwa Hanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Bwanyima Hanna yaasiima naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Omutima gwangye nigwesiimira omuri MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Eihembe ryangye ritunguuriirwe omuri MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">N'akanwa kangye nikashekyerera abazigu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Ahakuba ninshemerererwa okujuna kwawe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:46">Luk 1:46</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 13:5">Zab 13:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Tihariho orikwera nka MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:2">Tihariho ondiijo kureka Iwe wenka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:2">Kandi tihariho Rukiri ori nka Ruhanga waitu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:11">Kur 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:3">Isa 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:25">Zab 73:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Mutagaruka kugamba eby'okwehimbisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">N'eby'amaryo birekye kuruga omu kanwa kaanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">Ahakuba MUKAMA ni Ruhanga orikumanya byona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">Kandi niwe arenga ebi abantu bakora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:13">Mal 3:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Amata g'amamanzi gahendekire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:4">Kwonka abarikutsibaaza beezirikire amaani.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Abaabaire nibaiguta, hati nibakorera eby'okurya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">N'abaabaire baine enjara, tibakigiine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Eego, engumba ezaire mushanju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">N'ow'abaana baingi atentebukire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:53">Luk 1:53</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 113:9">Zab 113:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />MUKAMA aita, kandi akiza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:6">Ashuumya okuzimu, kandi aihayo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:39">Bir 32:39</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:25">Yoh 11:25</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:26">26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />MUKAMA ainaza, kandi atungisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:7">Agarura ahansi, kandi atunguura.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Yob 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:7">Zab 75:7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Aimutsya abooro omu mucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Aiha abakyene omu rubungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Kubashutamya n'abanyiginya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Kandi n'okuhungura ekitebe ky'ekitiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Ahakuba enyomyo z'ensi n'eza MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Kandi nizo yaagihangiriize.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:17">Dan 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:17">1 Sam 15:17</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:5">Yak 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:21">Kush 3:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Aryarinda ebigyere by'abarikwera be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">Kwonka ababi baryahwerekyererera omu mwirima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">Ahakuba tihariho muntu orisinguza amaani ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Zab 91:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Abarwanisa MUKAMA baryacwanyagurika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Abahindireho naayema omu iguru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">MUKAMA aryacwera emperu z'ensi orubanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Aryaheereza omugabe we amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Atunguure eihembe ry'ou yaashukireho amajuta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:13">Zab 96:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Bwanyima Elukaana yaagaruka omu ka ye Raama; kandi omwana yaaguma naaheereza MUKAMA omu maisho ga Eli omunyamurwa.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebibi bya beene Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:28">Rom 1:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi batabani ba Eli bakaba bari abantu abataine mugasho, abatarikumanya MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Ogu nigwo gwabaire guri omucwe gw'abo banyamurwa omu mitwarize yaabo n'abantu. Omuntu weena ku yaabaire atamba ekitambo, omuheereza w'omunyamurwa aija bakiteekire enyama, aine orwoma rw'amaino ashatu omu ngaro; <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />arucumita omu safuriya, nari omu binika, nari omu nyungu, nari omu rwabya; ekintu kyona eki orwoma rwabaire rujaburamu, nikyo omunyamurwa yaabaire atwara. Okwo nikwo baabaire batwaza Abaisraeli boona abaabaire baza Shiilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Kandi ebishaju ku byabaire biba bitakookiibwe, omuheereza w'omunyamurwa akaba aija, agira orikutamba ati: Mpa enyama y'okwokyeza omunyamurwa; ahabw'okuba tarikwenda eteekire, kureka embisi. <verse eid="1SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Kandi ogwo muntu akimugarukamu ati: Ka babanze bootsye ebishaju, obone kutwara ei orikwenda yoona, onu amugarukamu ati: Ngaaha! Gimpe hati; kandi ku oraayangye, ningitwaza amaani. <verse eid="1SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:8">Mal 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo ekibi ky'abo batsigazi kyabaire kihango omu maisho ga MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba bikareetera abantu kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo babitamirwe.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samueli okutandika kuheereza MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 28:4">Kur 28:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Samueli akatandika kuheereza MUKAMA akiri omwana muto, ajwaire efodi ya kitaani. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Kandi nyina akaba amubaziirira akakooti, akamutwarira buri mwaka, nainamuka na iba kutamba ekitambo kya buri mwaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Kandi Eli akaba ashabira Elukaana n'omukazi we omugisha naagira ati: MUKAMA akuhe oruzaaro omuri ogu mukazi omu mwanya gw'ogu ou yaahongyeire MUKAMA. Batyo bagaruka owaabo. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:40">Luk 2:40</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaataayaayira Hanna, yaagira enda, yaazaara abaana b'aboojo bashatu n'abaishiki babiri. Omwana ogwo Samueli yaakurira omu maisho ga MUKAMA.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya beene Eli n'ekifubiro kyabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Omu bunaku obwo Eli akaba ahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru; yaaguma naahurira byona ebi abatabani baabaire nibakora omu Baisraeli boona, kandi n'oku barikushambana n'abakazi, abaabaire baheereza aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Yaababuuza ati: N'enki ekirikubakoresa ebirikushusha bityo? Ahakuba nimpurira omu bantu boona eby'emicwe yaanyu emibi. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Ngaaha, baana bangye! Ebi ndikuhurira abantu nibabagambaho ti birungi; nimusiisisa abantu ba MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:30">Bir 2:30</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:10">Enf 15:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:39">Yoh 12:39</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:40">40</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ku arikushiisha ahari mugyenzi we, Ruhanga naamucwera orubanja; mbwenu omuntu ku arikushiisha ahari Ruhanga, n'oha orikubaasa kumweshengyerereza? Kwonka baayanga kuhurira ishebo, ahakuba MUKAMA akaba naayenda kubaita.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 2:40">Luk 2:40</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:18">Rom 14:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo mwana Samueli yaagumizamu naakura, naasiimwa MUKAMA n'abantu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 13:1">1 Bag 13:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima haija omuntu wa Ruhanga ahari Eli, yaamugira ati: MUKAMA naagira ati: Noomanya ku naayeyorekire eka ya sho, obu baabaire bari omu buhuuku bw'enju ya Faraho. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kur 28:1</ref>. </char></note> Niwe naatooraine omu nganda zoona eza Israeli kuba omunyamurwa wangye, okuza aha itambiro ryangye, okwotera obubaane, n'okujwara efodi omu maisho gangye. Kandi nkaha oruganda rwa sho empongano z'Abaisraeli zoona ez'ebitambo by'okwotsya omu muriro. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:15">Bir 32:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:12">Mal 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ahabw'enki nimureebesa omururu ebitambo byangye n'empongano zangye, ezi naaragiire kumpongyera, okaha batabani baawe ekitiinisa okunkira, ngu mweyitirire n'ebicweka ebirikukira oburungi by'empongano zoona ezi abantu bangye Abaisraeli barikumpongyera? <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:20">Zab 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:14">91:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:44">Yoh 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:26">12:26</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:9">Mal 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugirira ati: N'ekya buzima nkaba ngizire nti; Ab'enju yaawe n'ab'enju ya sho nibo bariguma nibaheereza omu maisho gangye ebiro byona; mbwenu hati MUKAMA naagira ati: Nikikabure! Ahakuba abarikumpa ekitiinisa, nibo ndikiha; kwonka abarikungaya, baryagaywa. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Reeba, ebiro nibiija, obu ndimaraho amaani gaawe n'ag'enju ya sho, hakabura omugurusi omu nju yaawe. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Kandi omu kubonabona kwawe oryareebesa eihari ebirungi byona ebi Abaisraeli bariheebwa omu Butaaho bwangye; n'omu nju yaawe tiharibamu mugurusi ebiro byona. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Ku harigira omuntu waawe owaahonokaho, akatsigara aha itambiro ryangye, aryaba ow'okukuhwereza amaisho noorira, n'okukusaasa omutima; oruzaaro rw'enju yaawe rwona ruryahenderwa omunyeeto. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:11">1 Sam 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Ako kagwe akarigwera batabani baawe bombi, Hofuni na Finehaasi, karyakubeera akamanyiso; bombi baryafa eizooba rimwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:35">1 Bag 2:35</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:17">Heb 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:26-28">7:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:11">2 Sam 7:11</ref>. </char></note> Naanye ndyayeimukiza omunyamurwa orikwesigwa, orikora nk'ebindi aha mutima n'omu biteekateeko oku biri. Ndyamwombekyera enju ehamire; kandi aryaheerereza omu maisho g'ou naashukireho amajuta ebiro byona. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:27">1 Bag 2:27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima weena oriba yaatsigaireho omu nju yaawe, aryaija, amukwate amaguru ngu amuhe akacweka k'efeeza nari omugaati, amushabe ati: Ninkweshengyereza, mpa omurimo gumwe aha y'abanyamurwa, beitu nkaabona ak'okurya.<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okwetwa kwa Samueli n'okworekwa kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 74:9">Zab 74:9</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:11">Amo 8:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwana Samueli akaba aheereza MUKAMA naategyekwa Eli. Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaba kiri eky'eicweka omu biro ebyo, hatariho kworekwa kwa butunu.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Omu bunaku obwo Eli amaisho ge gakaba gaagiirwemu oruho, atakihweza gye. Ekiro kimwe, ku yaabaire abyami omu mwanya gwe, <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:21">Kur 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:7">30:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:8">8</ref>. </char></note> etabaaza ya Ruhanga etakaraire, na Samueli abyami omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA, ahu eshanduukye ya Ruhanga yaabaire eri, <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />MUKAMA yaayeta Samueli; nawe yaamwetaba ati: Ndi aha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Yairuka, yaaza ahari Eli, yaamugira ati: Naija, ahakuba waanyeta. Eli yaamugira ati: Tinaakweta; garukayo obyame. Yaagarukayo, yaabyama. <verse eid="1SA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />MUKAMA yaagaruka yaamweta ati: Samueli! Samueli yaimuka yaaza ahari Eli, yaagira ati: Naija, ahakuba waanyeta. Yaamugarukamu ati: Tinaakweta, mwana wangye; garukayo obyame. <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Yer 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:2">Byak 19:2</ref>. </char></note> Obwo Samueli akaba atakamanyire MUKAMA, n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaba kitakamushuururiirwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />MUKAMA yaayeta Samueli omurundi gwa kashatu. Yaimuka, yaaza ahari Eli, yaagira ati: Naija; ahakuba waanyeta. Ekyo kyamanyisa Eli ku MUKAMA niwe arikweta ogwo mwana. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Nikyo Eli yaagiriire Samueli ati: Irooko obyame; ku araagarukye yaakweta, ogire oti: Gamba, MUKAMA; ahakuba omwiru waawe ahuriire. Samueli nikwo kugarukayo, akabyama.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 85:8">Zab 85:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:6">Byak 9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaija, yaayemerera aho, yaamweta nk'oku yaaheza kumweta, ati: Samueli, Samueli! Na Samueli yaayetaba naagira ati: Gamba; ahakuba omwiru waawe ahuriire. <verse eid="1SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />MUKAMA yaagira Samueli ati: Reeba, ndyakora ekintu omuri Israeli, ekirireetera amatu g'orikihurira weena kuteera enduuru. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Eryo izooba ndyahikiiriza ahari Eli ebi naagaambire aha nju ye byona, okwiha obu byatandika n'okuhitsya aha muheru gwabyo. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:12">1 Sam 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 2:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nkamugambira ku ndiha enju ye ekifubiro eky'ebiro byona, nimbatura eby'okushiisha ebi yaamanyire; ahabw'okuba batabani be bakeeshiisha, tiyaabazibira. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:14">Isa 22:14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:26-31">Heb 10:26-31</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ndahiriire enju ya Eli nti: Eby'okushiisha by'enju ya Eli tibirihongyererwa yaaba kitambo nari empongano ebiro byona.<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samueli yaabyama, bwarugaho bwasheesha; ku yaimukire, yaigura enyigi z'enju ya MUKAMA; yaatiina kugambira Eli ebi ayorekirwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Bwanyima Eli yaayeta Samueli, naagira ati: Samueli mwana wangye! Onu ati: Ndi aha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="1SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli yaamubuuza ati: MUKAMA akugambiire ki? Ninkweshengyereza, otakinshereka. Ku oraagire eki wanshereka omuri ebyo byona ebi akugambiire, Ruhanga akikuture, n'okukiraho. <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:9">Zab 39:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:8">Isa 30:8</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:6">1 Pet 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Samueli yaamugambira byona, tiyaagira ki yaamushereka. Onu ati: Ni MUKAMA; ka akore eki arikusiima kyona.<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 9:6">1 Sam 9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Samueli yaakura; MUKAMA yaaguma nawe, tiyaareka kigambo kye na kimwe kufa busha. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />N'Abaisraeli boona, okuruga Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba, baamanya ku Samueli ahamiibwe kuba nabi wa MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:6">Kub 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:1">Heb 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagaruka yaayeyoreka omuri Shiilo; ahakuba MUKAMA akeeyorekyera Samueli Shiilo omu kigambo kye. Kandi ekigambo kya Samueli kyahika aha Baisraeli boona.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abafilistia okunyaga eshanduukye ya MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 7:12">1 Sam 7:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli bakahurura kurwanisa Abafilistia; baateera orusiisira rwabo aha rubaju rwa Ebenezeeri; n'Abafilistia nabo baateera orwabo ahari Afeki. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Abafilistia baatenga orugamba kurwanisa Abaisraeli; ku baarwaine, Abafilistia baabinga Abaisraeli, babaitamu abantu enkumi ina. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Engabo ku zaagarukire omu rusiisira, abakuru ba Israeli baabuuzana bati: Ahabw'enki MUKAMA yaatubingisa omu maisho g'Abafilistia eri izooba? Ka tuze kwenda eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, tugiihe Shiilo, tugireete aha; ku eraatuhikyemu, etujune omu mikono y'abazigu baitu. <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:2">2 Sam 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:18">Kur 25:18</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 7:89">Kub 7:89</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baatuma abantu Shiilo, baihayo eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA ow'amahe, oshutami ahari baakerubi. Kandi beene Eli bombi, Hofuni na Finehaasi, abaabaire bari hamwe n'eshanduukye y'endagaano ya Ruhanga, baija nayo.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA ku yaahikire omu rusiisira, Abaisraeli boona baateera munonga akaari, ensi yaateera obwaku. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Abafilistia ku baahuriire orwo rwari, baagira bati: Orwo rwari rwingi oruri omu rusiisira rw'Abaheburaayo n'orw'enki? Bwanyima baamanya ku eshanduukye ya MUKAMA yaahika omu rusiisira rwabo. <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Abafilistia baatiina, ahakuba bakagira bati: Ruhanga yaahika omu rusiisira rwabo. Baagaruka baagira bati: Eshi twareeba enaku! Ahabw'okuba tihakabahoga kintu nk'eki okwiha ira ryona. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Twareeba enaku! N'oha oraabaase kutujuna baaruhanga aba ab'amaani? Aba nibo baaruhanga abaitsiize Abanyamisri enfu za buri muringo omu ihamba. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 10:12">2 Sam 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:10">Efe 6:10</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Mube ab'amaani, murwane mashaija, imwe Bafilistia 'mwe, murekye kuba abahuuku b'Abaheburaayo, nk'oku baabaire bari ahariimwe, mufe mashaija murwane. <verse eid="1SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:17">Lev 26:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:25">Bir 28:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:62">Zab 78:62</ref>. </char></note> Batyo Abafilistia baarwana; Abaisraeli baabingwa, baahunga, buri muntu yairukira omu ihema rye; haabaho kwitwa kuhango; ahakuba Abaisraeli bakafamu abantu abarikugyendesa ebigyere obukumi bushatu. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:64">Zab 78:64</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eshanduukye ya Ruhanga yaanyagwa, na beene Eli bombi Hofuni na Finehaasi baitwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 7:6">Yos 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:32">2 Sam 15:32</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:1">Neh 9:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija Omubenyamiini yaacwa omu ngabo, yaahika Shiilo eryo izooba, ebijwaro bye bitaagukire, n'eitaka rimuri omu mutwe. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:9">1 Sam 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Obu yaija, Eli akaba ashutami aha kitebe kye aha rubaju rw'omuhanda, ataireyo amaisho; ahakuba omutima gukaba gumuhweire omunda ahabw'eshanduukye ya Ruhanga. Ogwo mushaija ku yaahikire omu rurembo, yaabagambira ebibaireho; ab'omu rurembo boona baayeha ekiboroogo. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli ku yaahuriire okwo kuborooga, yaabuuza ati: Okwo kujagarara n'okw'enki? Ogwo mushaija yaija naayehuuta, yaabimugambira. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Obwo Eli akaba ahikize emyaka makumi mwenda na munaana; amaisho ge gaahumire, atakihweza. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:4">2 Sam 1:4</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mushaija yaagira Eli ati: Niinye ogwo owaaruga omu rugamba eri izooba, naacwa omu ngabo. Onu yaamubuuza ati: Bibaire bita, mwana wangye? <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Ogwo owaareeta amakuru yaamugarukamu ati: Abaisraeli baahunga Abafilistia, haabaho okwitwa kw'abantu baingi, batabani baawe bombi, Hofuni na Finehaasi, baafa; kandi eshanduukye ya Ruhanga yaanyagwa. <verse eid="1SA 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Ku yaagambire eby'eshanduukye ya Ruhanga, Eli yaaruga aha kitebe kye, yaagwa agarami aha kiti ky'omuryango, yaahendeka ebitsya, yaafa; ahakuba akaba ari omugurusi, orikweremeera. Kandi akaba amazire emyaka makumi ana naacwera Abaisraeli emanja.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Obwo mukaamwana wa Eli, muka Finehaasi, akaba aine enda ari haihi kuzaara; ku yaahuriire enkuru ngu eshanduukye ya Ruhanga enyagirwe, kandi ngu ishezaara na iba baafa, yaafukama, yaazaara, ahakuba ebisha bikamukwatira aho. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:17">Kut 35:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire ari haihi kufa, abakazi abaabaire nibamuzaaza, baamugira bati: Otatiina; ahabw'okuba waazaara omwana w'omwojo. Kwonka tiyaabagarukamu, n'obu kwakuba okukyetaho. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:61">Zab 78:61</ref>. </char></note> Yaayeta ogwo mwana Ikabodi, naagira ati: Ekitiinisa kyaruga ahari Israeli. Yaakigamba ahabw'eshanduukye ya Ruhanga kunyagwa, n'ahabw'ebya ishezaara na iba. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Kandi yaagira ati: Ekitiinisa kyaruga ahari Israeli; ahabw'okuba eshanduukye ya Ruhanga yaanyagwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Eshanduukye ya Ruhanga okwiha Dagoni omu mwanya gwe n'okubonabonesa Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Abafilistia ku baaherize kunyaga eshanduukye ya Ruhanga, baagiiha Ebenezeeri, baagitwara Ashidoodi; <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />baagitaasya omu ndaaro ya Dagoni, baagita aha rubaju rwe. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:11">Kur 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 16:23">Bar 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:24-26">1 Bus 16:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:14">Nah 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Omu kasheeshe abantu ba Ashidoodi ku baimukire kare, baashanga Dagoni agwire ajuumaire ahansi omu maisho g'eshanduukye ya MUKAMA. Baamujuumuura, baamugarura aha mwanya gwe. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:2">Yer 50:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 6:6">Ezk 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku baimukire kare omu kasheeshe akaakuratsireho, baashanga Dagoni agwire ajuumaire ahansi omu maisho g'eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, kandi omutwe gwe n'engaro ze bicwirweho, biri omu muryango; haatsigaire ekihinju kya ifo kyonka. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Eki nikyo abagirwa ba Dagoni n'abataaha omu ndaaro ya Dagoni boona omuri Ashidoodi bataribatira mu kisasi ky'omuryango n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:3">Kur 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:3">Isa 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:27">Bir 28:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omukono gwa MUKAMA gwahingamira abantu ba Ashidoodi n'ab'omu butegyeki bwayo; yaabatiinisa, kandi yaababonabonesa n'ebizimba. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Abantu ba Ashidoodi ku baareebire byaba bityo, baagira bati: Eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli etaguma naitwe; ahabw'okuba omukono gwe gutuhingamiire na ruhanga waitu Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Nikwo kutuma abategyeki b'Abafilistia boona kuteeranira hamwe, bakagira bati: Tugire tuta eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli? Baabagarukamu bati: Eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli mugyohererezane, ehikye Gaasi. Batyo baayohererezana eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli, baagihitsyayo. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:15">Bir 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:13">1 Sam 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:66">Zab 78:66</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ku baaherize kugihitsyayo, omukono gwa MUKAMA gwarwanisa orwo rurembo, yaabahahaaza emitima munonga; yaarwaza abanyarurembo, abato n'abakuru, ebizimba aha mibiri yaabo. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo eshanduukye ya Ruhanga baagyohereza Ekurooni; aba Ekurooni ku baagicwire eriisho neija, baayombera kimwe nibagira bati: Boohererezaine eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli, mbwenu baagituhitsyaho kutwita n'abantu baitu. <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo baatuma abategyeki b'Abafilistia boona, baateeranira aho, aba Ekurooni baabagira bati: Mwohereze eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli, egarukye omu mwanya gwayo, erekye kutwita n'abantu baitu. Ahabw'okuba omuri orwo rurembo rwona hakaba hariho okuhahaaza emitima ahabw'okutiina kufa; n'omukono gwa MUKAMA gubahingamiire munonga. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 11:6">Kur 11:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 15:3">Isa 15:3</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija abaatsigaireho batafiire, baarwara ebizimba; n'okuborooga kw'orwo rurembo kwahika omu iguru.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Abafilistia okugarurayo eshanduukye ya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Eshanduukye ya MUKAMA yaamara ameezi mushanju omu nsi y'Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8">Kut 41:8</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:4">Mat 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abafilistia baayeta abagirwa n'abafumu, baababuuza bati: Egi shanduukye ya MUKAMA tugigire tuta? Mutuhabure oku turaagigarureyo, tukagihitsya omu mwanya gwayo. <verse eid="1SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:15">Kur 23:15</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:6">Lev 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Baabagarukamu bati: Ku muraayohereze eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli, mutagyohereza yonka; kureka mucwe obwengye bwona kugigarurayo n'empongano y'okwihaho orubanja. Obwo nibwo muraakire, kandi mukamanya ekizibiire omukono gwe kubarugaho. <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:3">Yos 13:3</ref>. </char></note> Banu bagira bati: Ni mpongano ki ey'okwihaho orubanja ei turaamwoherereze? Baagarukamu bati: Ebizimba bitaano by'ezaabu, n'embeba itaano z'ezaabu, nk'omubaro gw'abategyeki b'Abafilistia oku gurikwingana; ahakuba imwe mwena n'abategyeki baanyu mukajuumikirwa orwo rufu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:19">Yos 7:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 13:16">Yer 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:7">Kush 14:7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mushemereire kuheesha ebishushani by'ebizimba byanyu, n'eby'embeba ezirikushiisha ensi yaanyu; kandi muryaha Ruhanga wa Israeli ekitiinisa; obundi akaatuubya oburemeezi bw'omukono gwe ahariimwe, n'ahari baaruhanga baanyu, n'ahansi yaanyu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:19">Kur 3:19</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 6:1">6:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:38">Zab 105:38</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu shi nimugangaariza ki emitima, nk'Abanyamisri na Faraho oku baagangaize eyaabo? Obu yaakora eby'amahano omuribo, tibararekire abo bantu bakarugayo, bakagyenda? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:3">2 Sam 6:3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati mureete ekigaari kisya, mukiboneze, n'ente ibiri ezirikwontsya, ezitakakururaga kintu, muzikomeho ekigaari, muzaakye enyana zaazo, muzigarure omuka; <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />bwanyima mutware eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, mugite aha kigaari, kandi n'ebintu by'ezaabu, ebi murikumwoherereza kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja, mubite omu kashanduukye aha rubaju rwayo; bwanyima mugyohereze, egyende. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Kandi mureebe ahu eraatoore; ku eraarabe ogurikuza aha mwatano gwayo, yaagyema Beti-shemeshi, nitwija kumanya ku MUKAMA niwe atureeteire aka kabi koona; kandi ku kiraabe kitabaire kityo, nabwo nitwija kumanya ku gutari mukono gwe ogwatwitsire; kureka ku kari akagwe akatugwereire.<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Abo bashaija baatwaza batyo, baareeta ente ibiri zirikwontsya, baazikomaho ekigaari, enyana zaazo baazikingira omuka; <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />baata eshanduukye ya MUKAMA aha kigaari, baataho n'akashanduukye akarimu embeba eziheesire omu zaabu n'ebishushani by'ebizimba byabo. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ezo nte zaatoora omuhanda ogurikucwekanisa niguza Beti-shemeshi, zaagumizamu omu muhanda rugyendwa nizijuga, tizaakiikama ha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho; kandi abategyeki b'Abafilistia baagyenda bazikuratiire okuhika aha mwatano gwa Beti-shemeshi. <verse eid="1SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Eryo izooba aba Beti-shemeshi bakaba nibagyesha engano omu ruhita; ku baanagire amaisho, baareeba eshanduukye, baashemererwa munonga kugireeba. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Ekyo kigaari kyahika omu musiri gwa Yoshua owa Beti-shemeshi, kyayemerera aho, ahu eibaare rihango ryabaire riri; bwanyima baashatura embaaho z'ekyo kigaari, baatambira aho ezo nte kuba ekitambo ky'okwokyeza MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Abaleevi baihaho eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, n'akashanduukye akaabaire kari hamwe nayo, akarimu ebyo bintu by'ezaabu, baabita aha mutwe gw'eryo ibaare rihango; kandi eryo izooba aba Beti-shemeshi baatambira MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:3">Yos 13:3</ref>. </char></note> Abo bategyeki ku baaherize kubireeba, baagaruka Ekurooni eryo izooba.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Ebi nibyo bizimba by'ezaabu ebi Abafilistia baahongyeire MUKAMA kuba empongano y'okwihaho orubanja; kimwe aha bwa Ashidoodi, ekindi ahabwa Gaaza, ekindi ahabwa Ashikelooni, ekindi ahabwa Gaasi, n'ekindi ahabwa Ekurooni; <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />kandi n'embeba z'ezaabu, nk'omubaro gw'endembo zoona ez'Abafilistia, ezaabaire nizitwarwa abo bategyeki bataano, oku gwabaire guri, endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare, n'ebirorero by'omu byaro. Kandi eryo ibaare rihango, eri baataireho eshanduukye ya MUKAMA aha rubaju omu musiri gwa Yoshua owa Beti-shemeshi, niryo kareebi n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:21">Kur 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 4:20">Kub 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 6:7">2 Sam 6:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaita abantu ba Beti-shemeshi makumi mushanju, ahabw'okuringuriza omu shanduukye ya MUKAMA; abantu baacura munonga, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akabaitamu abantu baingi. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:9">2 Sam 6:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija ba Beti-shemeshi baagira bati: N'oha orikubaasa kwemerera omu maisho ga MUKAMA, Ruhanga ogu orikwera? Kandi ku araaturugyeho, naaza ahari oha? <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 13:5">1 Bus 13:5</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 13:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baatuma entumwa aha batwire Kiryasi-yearimu, nibagira bati: Abafilistia bagarwire eshanduukye ya MUKAMA. Mushuume, mugiinamure owaanyu.<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:6">Zab 132:6</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 6:4">2 Sam 6:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aba Kiryasi-yearimu baija, baatwara eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, baagiinamura, baagitaasya omu nju ya Abinadabu eyaabaire eri aha kabungo; bwanyima baashoroora omutabani Eleazaari okurinda egyo shanduukye ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okweteisiza MUKAMA, n'okusingura Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Okwiha aha izooba eri eshanduukye ya MUKAMA yaataahiireho Kiryasi-yearimu, hakahinguraho omwanya muraingwa; ahakuba ogwo mwanya gwona gukahika emyaka makumi abiri. Ab'enju ya Israeli boona baatakira MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:7">Isa 55:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:12">Yoel 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:2">Kut 35:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:14">Yos 24:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:19">2 Bus 30:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaabagambira ati: Ku muraagarukye ahari MUKAMA n'omutima gwanyu gwona, mwihe omuriimwe baaruhanga b'enduga-mahanga n'aba Ashitaroosi, mushemereze MUKAMA emitima yaanyu, mube niwe mwaheereza wenka; nawe naija kubakiza, abaihe omu mikono y'Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Batyo Abaisraeli baihaho Baabaali n'aba Ashitaroosi, baaheereza MUKAMA wenka.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Samueli yaaragiira ati: Muteeranire Abaisraeli boona Mizipa, nyije mbashabire ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:14">2 Sam 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:1">Neh 9:1</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 9:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:3">Dan 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:6">Zab 106:6</ref>. </char></note> Baateeranira Mizipa, baataha amaizi, baagashuka omu maisho ga MUKAMA; eryo izooba baayesiibyakwo, nibagira bati: Tukacumura ahari MUKAMA. Obwo Samueli yaatandika kucwera Abaisraeli emanja ahari Mizipa. <verse eid="1SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Abafilistia ku baahuriire ngu Abaisraeli bateeraniire Mizipa, abategyeki baabo bainamuka kurwanisa Abaisraeli. Abaisraeli ku baakihuriire, baabatiina. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:4">Isa 37:4</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baashaba Samueli nibagira bati: Otareka kutakira MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ahabwaitu, abone kutujuna omu mikono y'Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 99:6">Zab 99:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:1">Yer 15:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Samueli yaatwara omwana gw'entaama gurikwonka, yaaguhongyera MUKAMA kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya; Samueli yaatakira MUKAMA ahabw'Abaisraeli, MUKAMA yaamugarukamu. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:10">Yos 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:14">2 Sam 22:14</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 22:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Samueli ku yaabaire naahonga ekitambo eky'okwotsya, Abafilistia bairira haihi kurwanisa Abaisraeli; kwonka MUKAMA yaahinda okuhinda kw'amaani aha Bafilistia eryo izooba, yaabarabanisamu, baabingwa omu maisho g'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Abaisraeli baaruga Mizipa, baakurata Abafilistia, baagyenda nibabaita, baabahitsya Besi-kaari. <verse eid="1SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Bwanyima Samueli yaakwata eibaare, yaaribyara ahagati ya Mizipa na Sheeni, yaaryeta eiziina Ebenezeeri, naagira ati: MUKAMA naakituhwera n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="1SA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 13:3">1 Sam 13:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo Abafilistia baacwirwe eishaija, batagarukye kurenga omwatano gw'Abaisraeli. Omu biro byona ebya Samueli omukono gwa MUKAMA gukaguma nigurwanisa Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Kandi endembo ezi Abafilistia baabaire banyagire Abaisraeli, zaabagarurirwa, okuruga Ekurooni n'okuhika Gaasi; Abaisraeli baiha ensi yaabo omu mikono y'Abafilistia; haabaho obusingye ahagati y'Abaisraeli n'Abaamori.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samueli yaaguma naacwera Abaisraeli emanja ebiro bye byona. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Kandi buri mwaka akaba arambura Beseeli, Gilugaali na Mizipa, naacwera Abaisraeli emanja omuri egyo myanya yoona; <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />bwanyima agaruka Raama; ahakuba eka ye niyo yaabaire eri; okwo niyo yaabaire acwerera Abaisraeli emanja; kandi niyo yaayombekyeire MUKAMA eitambiro.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okweshabira omugabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:18">Bir 16:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Samueli ku yaakuzire, yaataho abatabani kuba abaramuzi b'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Omwana we w'omujigaijo akaba naayetwa Yoeli; ow'omushubiro naayetwa Abiya; bakaba bari abaramuzi omuri Beeri-sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:19">Mub 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:21">Kur 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 3:3">1 Tim 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:10">6:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abo batabani tibaratwarize nka ishebo, kureka bakateishuka emihanda ye ahabw'okukunda empiiha, baaguma nibarya enguzi, kandi nibaita emanja z'abantu.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Bwanyima abakuru ba Israeli boona baayeteerana hamwe, baija ahari Samueli Raama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:13">1 Sam 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:10">Hos 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:21">Byak 13:21</ref>. </char></note> Baamugira bati: Reeba, okuzire; kandi batabani baawe tibarikutwaza nkaiwe; mbwenu otuteereho omugabe w'okututegyeka nk'agandi mahanga oku gatwaza. <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:11">1 Sam 15:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ekigambo ekyo kyagwisa kubi Samueli, eki baagizire bati: Otuhe omugabe, atutegyekye. Samueli yaashaba MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:8">Kur 16:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:19">1 Sam 10:19</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Samueli ati: Hurira ebi abo bantu barikukugambira byona; ahakuba tiiwe bangire, kureka niinye bangire ngu ntaba omugabe waabo. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Nk'ebi baakozire byona oku byabaire biri, okwiha aha izooba riri eri naabaihiireho Misri n'okuhitsya hati, obu baanyimuura, bakaheereza baaruhanga abandi, naiwe nikwo barikukugira. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati hurira eki barikukugambira; kwonka obeehanangiririze kimwe, noobashobororera emitwarize y'omugabe oribategyeka, oku eriba.<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Atyo Samueli yaagambira abantu abamushabire omugabe ebigambo bya MUKAMA byona. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:52">1 Sam 14:52</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:10-15">2 Bus 26:10-15</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Egi niyo eriba emitwarize y'omugabe oribategyeka; aryatwara batabani baanyu, abamwe abagire ab'ebigaari bye, n'ab'okugyendera aha mbaraasi ze, n'ab'okuguma nibairuka omu maisho g'ebigaari bye. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Abandi abateho kuba abakuru b'engabo rukumi-rukumi n'aba makumi ataano-ataano; abandi babe ab'okumuhingira, n'ab'okumugyeshera, abandi babe ab'okumuheeshera eby'okurwanisa, n'eby'okukoresa omu bigaari bye. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Kandi aryatwara bahara baanyu kuba ab'okukora eby'emigaju, n'ab'okuteeka eby'okurya, n'abateeki b'emigaati. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:7">1 Bag 21:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aryabaaka emisiri yaanyu, n'emizaabibu yaanyu, n'emizeituuni yaanyu, ebirikukira ebindi oburungi, abihe abaheereza be. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Kandi aryabaihaho kimwe kya ikumi ky'ebi muhunikire n'eky'emisiri yaanyu y'emizaabibu, abihe abakuru b'abantu be n'abaheereza be. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Kandi aryabanyaga abahuuku, n'abazaana baanyu, n'ente zaanyu ezirikukira oburungi, n'endogoya zaanyu, abikorese emirimo ye. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Kandi n'aha masyo gaanyu g'entaama n'ag'embuzi aryaihaho kimwe kya ikumi; naimwe muryaba abairu be. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 27:9">Yob 27:9</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:25">Enf 1:25</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:4">Mik 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo muryarira ahabw'ogwo mugabe waanyu ou muriba mwetooraniire; kwonka omuri obwo bunaku MUKAMA taribagarukamu.<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:4">Isa 66:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:16">Yer 44:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka abantu baayanga kuhurira ebi Samueli yaabagambira, baagira bati: Ngaaha; kureka nitwenda ngu tutegyekwe omugabe, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />naitwe tube nk'amahanga goona; omugabe waitu agume atucwere emanja, kandi atwebembere aturwanirire omu ngamba zaitu. <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samueli ku yaaherize kuhurira ebigambo by'abo bantu byona, yaabigambira MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:11">Hos 13:11</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Samueli ati: Hurira eki barikugamba, obateereho omugabe. Bwanyima Samueli yaagira abashaija ba Israeli ati: Mwirooko mugarukyeyo, buri muntu omu rurembo rw'owaabo.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saulo okusherura endogoya za ishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:21">Byak 13:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakaba hariho omushaija Omubenyamiini, orikwetwa Kiishi mwene Abieli, mwijukuru wa Zerori, mwene Bekoraasi ya Afia omwana w'Omubenyamiini, omushaija w'amaani emanzi. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:23">1 Sam 10:23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi akaba aine omutabani murungi omutsigazi, orikwetwa Saulo. Omu Baisraeli boona hakaba hatarimu orikumuhita; akaba naakira abantu boona aha mutwe, nibamugarukira aha ibega.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Eizooba rimwe endogoya za Kiishi, ishe wa Saulo, zikabura, Kiishi nikwo kugira omutabani Saulo ati: Twara omwe aha bairu baitu, mwimukye muze kusherura endogoya. <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Atyo Saulo yaagyenda yaaraba omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, n'omu nsi ya Shalisha; kwonka tibaazibona. Bwanyima baaraba omu nsi ya Shalimu, zaaburayo; baaraba omu nsi y'Ababenyamiini, nayo zaaburayo. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Ku baahikire omu nsi ya Zuufi, Saulo yaagira omwiru ou yaabaire aine ati: Ija, tugarukyeyo, taata atakaiha omutima aha ndogoya, akagwemereza ahabwaitu. <verse eid="1SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:11">1 Bag 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:19">1 Sam 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaamugira ati: Reeba, omuri ruriya rurembo harimu omuntu wa Ruhanga; kandi n'omuntu w'ekitiinisa. Ebi agamba byona, buzima bibakwo. Mbwenu tuzeyo; obundi akaatushobororera eby'oru rugyendo rwaitu oru turimu. <verse eid="1SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:18">Bar 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:3">1 Bag 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:42">2 Bag 4:42</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaabuuza omwiru we ati: Mbwenu shi, ku turaazeyo, ogwo mushaija nitumutwarira ki? Ahakuba entanda zihweire omu nshaho zaitu, kandi titwine mukimbo gw'okutwarira ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga. Mbwenu twine ki? <verse eid="1SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Omwiru we yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba, nyine omu ngaro ekicweka kimwe kya kana kya shekeli y'efeeza; nikyo ndaaheereze ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga, akabona kutuhabura omuhanda. <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:22">Kut 25:22</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 24:11">2 Sam 24:11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 7:12">Amo 7:12</ref>. </char></note> (Obunyakare omuri Israeli, omuntu ku yaabaire aza kwehanuuza ahari Ruhanga, akaba agira ati: Ija tuze ow'omuhanuuzi; ahabw'okuba orikwetwa nabi omu biro ebi, ira akaba ayetwa omuhanuuzi.) <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Saulo yaagira omwiru we ati: Ebi waagamba nibyo; ija tugyende. Batyo baataaha omu rurembo omu ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga yaabaire ari.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:16">Kur 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibakiinamuka akabungo nibaza omu rurembo, baabugana abaishiki nibaza kutaha amaizi, baababuuza bati: Omuhanuuzi ariyo? <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:2">1 Sam 16:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:2">1 Bag 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Baabagarukamu bati: Ariyo; reeba ari omu maisho gaanyu aho; mwehuute, ahabw'okuba nibwo yaija omu rurembo; kandi eri izooba abantu nibaija kutambira ebitambo omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Ku muraahikye omu rurembo, ahonaaho nimwija kumureeba, atakainamukire kuza kuriira omuri ogwo mwanya mukuru; kandi abantu tibarikubaasa kurya atakaizire, ahakuba niwe ashemereire kushabira ekitambo omugisha; bwanyima abeetsirwe bakabona kurya. Mbwenu mwinamukye; nimwija kumubugana hati. <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Batyo bainamuka nibaza omu rurembo; ku baabaire nibakitaahamu, baabugana Samueli naashohora, naaza omuri ogwo mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samueli okumanya Saulo ku niwe Ruhanga atooraine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:14">Zab 25:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eryo izooba eri Saulo yaiziireho, MUKAMA akaba araire ashuururiire Samueli, naamugira ati: <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:1">1 Sam 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:25">Kur 2:25</ref>. </char></note> Nyencakare nk'aga magingo niinyija kukwoherereza omushaija orikuruga omu nsi ya Benyamiini, omushukyeho amajuta g'okumushoroora kuba omugabe w'abantu bangye Abaisraeli; kandi niwe arijuna abantu bangye, akabaiha omu mikono y'Abafilistia; kandi ndeebire abantu bangye, ahabw'okuba okutaka kwabo kumpikireho. <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samueli ku yaareebire Saulo, MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Ngugwo omushaija ou nkugambiire! Niwe aritegyeka abantu bangye. <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Atyo Saulo yaashanga Samueli omu irembo ahu yaabaire ari, yaamubuuza ati: Ninkweshengyereza, mpabura ahu enju y'omuhanuuzi eri. <verse eid="1SA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samueli yaamugarukamu ati: Manya niinye muhanuuzi; mbwenu nyebembera, tuze omu mwanya mukuru; ahakuba eri izooba nimwija kurya naanye; kandi nyencakare omu kasheeshe niinyija kukwohereza, naaheza kukushobororera ebikuri aha mutima byona. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Kandi eby'endogoya zaawe ezimazire ebiro bishatu zibuzire, birekye kukwemereza omutima; ahakuba zibonekire. Mbwenu ebirungi by'omuri Israeli byona bibiikiirwe oha? Tiiwe n'enju ya sho yoona? <verse eid="1SA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:27">Zab 68:27</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:15">Bar 6:15</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaamugarukamu ati: Torikumanya ku ndi Omubenyamiini, ow'omu ruganda orurikukira obukye omu nganda za Israeli? Kandi omu miryango y'oruganda rwa Benyamiini yoona, ogwaitu tigwo gurikukira obukye? Ahabw'enki nongambira ebigambo nk'ebyo?<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Samueli yaatwara Saulo n'omwiru we, yaabataasya omu kishengye, yaabashutamya omu mwanya gw'ekitiinisa ahagati y'abeetsirwe, abaabaire bari nka makumi ashatu. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samueli yaagira omuteeki ati: Reeta omugabo ogu nkuhaire, nkakugira nti: Gubiikye. <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:32">Lev 7:32</ref>. </char></note> Omuteeki yaareeta ekivune ky'okuguru n'enyama zaakyo, yaakita omu maisho ga Saulo. Samueli yaagira ati: Reeba, ekibaire kibiikirwe, nkiki omu maisho gaawe; okirye; ahakuba kibaire kikubikiirwe okuhitsya aha bunaku obubaire butairweho, ngu obone kurya n'abeetsirwe. Atyo Saulo yaarya na Samueli eryo izooba. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Ku baarugire omuri ogwo mwanya mukuru, baashuuma omu rurembo, baatemba aha mutwe gw'enju, Samueli yaagaaniirirayo na Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Omu kasheeshe baimuka kare; ku bwabaire nibutaagurukana, Samueli yaayeta Saulo ayemi ahaiguru y'enju, yaamugira ati: Imuka, nkuragye. Saulo yaimuka; baashohora bombi, we na Samueli, baaza aheeru. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Ku baabaire nibashuuma kuhika ahu orurembo rurikugarukira, Samueli yaagira Saulo ati: Gambira omwiru waawe arabeho; ku araarabeho, haza iwe oyemerereho kakye, nkugambire ekigambo kya Ruhanga.<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Saulo okushukwaho amajuta okuba omugabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:13">1 Sam 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:9">Bir 32:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho Samueli yaakwata eihembe ry'amajuta, yaagamushuka aha mutwe, yaamunywegyera, yaagira ati: MUKAMA tiyaakushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe w'abantu be Israeli? <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Eri izooba ku orandugyeho, noija kubugana abashaija babiri aha kituuro kya Rakeeli, ahari Zeliza omu mwatano gwa Benyamiini, bakugire bati: Endogoya ezi obaire ogiire kusherura, zibonekire; mbwenu sho takyemereize mutima ahabw'endogoya, kureka agwemereize ahabwawe, naagira ati: Mbwenu ngire nta ahabw'omwana wangye? <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Bwanyima orugye aho, ogumizemu; ku oraahikye aha mwela gwa Tabora, noija kubugana abashaija bashatu nibainamuka Beseeli ahari Ruhanga, omwe ayekoreire abaana b'embuzi bashatu, ondi aine emigaati eshatu, n'ondiijo ayekoreire efurebe ya viinyo; <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />bakuramutsye, bakuhe emigaati ebiri, ogyakiire. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:15">2 Bag 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima noija kuhika aha kibungo kya Ruhanga, ahu engabo z'Abafilistia ziteire orusiisira; ku oraahikye omu rurembo, noija kubuganamu omutwe gwa baanabi nibaruga omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu, endingiri n'ebitaasa n'emikuri n'enanga bibeebembeire; kandi noija kushanga nibaragura. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:25">Kub 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 19:23">1 Sam 19:23</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA naija kukwijaho n'amaani, oragure nabo, ohindukye omuntu musya. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:12">Bar 6:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obwo bumanyiso ku buraakuhikyeho, okore nk'oku kiraabe nikyetengwa; ahakuba Ruhanga ari naiwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Bwanyima oshuume Gilugaali, ombandizeyo; naanye niinyija kukushangayo, kutamba ebitambo by'okwotsya n'eby'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; omareyo ebiro mushanju ontegyereize, okuhitsya obu ndaija, nkakushobororera eki oshemereire kukora.<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Ku yaateire ati Samueli amabega kumurugaho, Ruhanga yaamuha ogundi mutima; obw'okureeberaho obwo bwona bwahikiirira eryo izooba. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:20">1 Sam 19:20</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikire ahari ekyo kibungo, omutwe gwa baanabi gwamubugana, Omwoyo wa Ruhanga yaamwijaho n'amaani, yaaragura nabo. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:54">Mat 13:54</ref>. </char></note> Boona abaabaire nibamumanya obunyakare, ku baareebire naaragura hamwe na baanabi, baagambirana bati: Beitu mwene Kiishi yaaba ata? Saulo nawe ari omuri baanabi? <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:8">Yoh 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Omwe aha batwire omu mwanya ogwo yaabagarukamu naagira ati: Beitu shi ni beene oha? N'ahabw'ekyo kyahinduka enfumu, ngu: Saulo nawe ari omuri baanabi? <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Ku yaaherize kuragura, yaaza omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 14:50">1 Sam 14:50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ishento wa Saulo yaamubuuza n'omwiru we ati: Mubaire mugiire hi? Yaamugarukamu ati: Tubaire tugiire kusherura endogoya; ku tureebire zitaaboneka, twaza owa Samueli. <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Ishento yaagaruka yaagira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ngambira ebi Samueli akugambiire. <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Saulo yaagarukamu ishento ati: Atugambiriire kimwe ku endogoya zibonekire. Kwonka ebirikukwata aha by'obugabe, ebi Samueli agambire, tiyaabimugambira.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 20:1">Bar 20:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 11:15">1 Sam 11:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Samueli yaayeta abantu kuteeranira Mizipa omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:8">Bar 6:8</ref>. </char></note> yaagambira Abaisraeli ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Nkaiha Abaisraeli Misri, naabajuna naabaiha omu mikono y'abanyamisri, n'omu mikono y'abagabe boona abaabaire nibabaita kubi; <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:7">1 Sam 8:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:12">12:12</ref>. </char></note> kwonka eri izooba mwayanga Ruhanga waanyu, obajuna omu kabi kaanyu koona n'omu busaasi bwanyu; mbwenu mwangira muti: Ngaaha, kureka otuteereho omugabe. N'ahabw'ekyo hati mweyorekye omu maisho ga MUKAMA muri omu nganda zaanyu n'omu nkumi zaanyu.<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 7:14">Yos 7:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Samueli yairiza haihi enganda za Israeli zoona, oruganda rwa Benyamiini rwatooranwa. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Yairiza haihi oruganda rwa Benyamiini bari omu miryango yaabo, omuryango gwa Matiri gwatooranwa; na Saulo mwene Kiishi yaatooranwa. Kwonka ku baamusherwire, tiyaaboneka. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo baayongyera kwehanuuza ahari MUKAMA, nibamubuuza bati: Ogwo mushaija aizire aha? MUKAMA yaabagarukamu ati: Reeba, ayesherekire omu bintu. <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Baagyenda nibairuka, baamwihayo; ku yaayemereire ahagati yaabo, yaakira abantu boona aha mutwe, baamugarukira aha ibega. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samueli yaagira abantu boona ati: Nimureeba ou MUKAMA atooraine? Tihariho ori nkawe omu bantu boona. Abantu boona baateera akaari, nibagira bati: Omugabe nakaramaare!<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:14">Bir 17:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 8:11">1 Sam 8:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Samueli yaashobororera abantu emitwarize y'obugabe, yaagihandika omu kitabo, yaakibiika omu maisho ga MUKAMA. Samueli yaaraga abantu boona, buri omwe yaagaruka omu ka ye. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Saulo nawe yaataaha owe Gibea, yaagyenda n'omutwe gw'amamanzi, abu MUKAMA yaakozire aha mutima, bamushendekyereize. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:12">1 Sam 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:35">Byak 7:35</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 7:51">51</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 7:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:21">1 Bag 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:25">10:25</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abashaija bamwe abataine mugasho baagira bati: Omushaija ogu naabaasa ata kutujuna? Baamugaya, baayanga kumureetera entabaarutsyano. Kwonka we yaayehunamira.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Saulo okujuna aba Yabeshi-gileadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 21:8">Bar 21:8</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 31:11-13">1 Sam 31:11-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Nahashi Omuamoni yainamuka, yaateera Yabeshi-gileadi orusiisira kugirwanisa; aba Yabeshi boona baamugira bati: Tukorese endagaano, tugume tukuheereze. <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:26">1 Sam 17:26</ref>. </char></note> Nahashi Omuamoni yaabagira ati: Ku muraikirize ku mbanonkoramu amaisho ga buryo, niinyija kugibakoresa; kandi nkigire ekijumo ahari Israeli yoona. <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Abakuru ba Yabeshi baamugarukamu bati: Ba oturekire okumara ebiro mushanju, tubanze tutume entumwa, zirabe omuri Israeli yoona; ku turaabure kijuna, nitwija kukwehongyera.<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:4">Bar 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 21:2">21:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ezo ntumwa ku zaahikire Gibea owa Saulo, zaateekyerereza abantu ebyo bigambo; abantu boona baarira munonga, baaborooga. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Omuri ako kaanya Saulo yaija akuratiire ente, naaruga omu misiri; yaabuuza ati: Abantu aba baaba bata, ka nibaborooga? Baamuteekyerereza eby'aba Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:25">Bar 13:25</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 14:6">14:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:10">1 Sam 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:13">16:13</ref>. </char></note> Saulo ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebyo, Omwoyo wa Ruhanga yaamwijaho n'amaani, yaagira ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:5">Bar 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 14:14">2 Bus 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:10">17:10</ref>. </char></note> Yaihayo ente ibiri, yaaziita, yaazitematemamu ebicweka, yaabiha entumwa kubitwara omuri Israeli yoona, yaazituma ati: Weena oraayangye kuhurura na Saulo na Samueli, okwo nikwo ente ze ziraatwazibwe. Okutiinisa kwa MUKAMA kwakwata abantu, baahururira kimwe nk'omuntu omwe. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Ku yaabateeraniire Bezeki, yaababara, Abaisraeli baaba obusiriira bushatu, n'Abayuda baaba obukumi bushatu. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Bwanyima baagambira entumwa ziri eziizire, bati: Mugambire aba Yabeshi-gileadi muti: Nyencakare akashana kaatagata, nimwija kuheebwa emikono. Ezo ntumwa zaagyenda, zaabigambira aba Yabeshi; baashemererwa. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Aba Yabeshi nikwo kugambira Abaamoni bati: Nyencakare nitwija kubeehongyera, mutugire nk'oku murikwenda kwona. <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:11">1 Sam 31:11</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:16">Bar 7:16</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, Saulo yaabaganisa abantu omu mitwe eshatu, baayeshuka omu rusiisira rw'Abaamoni enkoko nizigamba, baabaita okuhitsya omu ihangwe; abaahonokireho baataataana, nangwa n'ababiri tibaaguma hamwe.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:27">1 Sam 10:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:27">Luk 19:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abantu baagira Samueli bati: Hari n'oha owaagizire ati: Ebyo Saulo aryatutegyeka? Mureete abo bashaija, tubaite. <verse eid="1SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:22">2 Sam 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 14:45">1 Sam 14:45</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Saulo yaagira ati: Hatagira omuntu n'omwe owaitwa eri izooba; ahakuba eri izooba MUKAMA yaakora eby'okujuna Abaisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Samueli yaagira abantu ati: Mwije tuze Gilugaali, tuhamizeyo obugabe. <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Abantu boona baaza Gilugaali; okwo niyo baayemekyeire Saulo omu maisho ga MUKAMA, bakatambirayo empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye omu maisho ge; kandi niyo Saulo n'Abaisraeli boona baayesiimiire munonga.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Samueli okwehanangiriza Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam 8:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Samueli yaagambira Abaisraeli boona ati: Reeba, nyikiriize ebi mwanshabire byona, naabateeraho omugabe w'okubategyeka. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Ogwo mugabe niwe arikubeebembera; nyowe nkuzire, naagizire enju; mbwenu reeba, batabani bangye bari hamwe naimwe. Kandi nyowe nkabeebembera okwiha omu butsigazi bwangye okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:15">Kub 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:33">Byak 20:33</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ndi aha; munyomesereze omu maisho ga MUKAMA n'omu maisho g'ogu muntu we, owaashukirweho amajuta. Ndanyagire ente y'oha? Ndanyagire endogoya y'oha? Nari ndaryangataniise oha? N'oha ou ndaitsire kubi? Nari shi n'oha ou ndariireho enguzi, kuunyita amaisho? Nkabimuriha. <verse eid="1SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Baamugarukamu bati: Tokaturyangatanisaga, kandi tokatwitaga kubi, n'obu kwakuba okunyaga ekintu ky'omuntu weena. <verse eid="1SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:16">Byak 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Zab 17:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: MUKAMA niwe mujurizi w'okubashinja, kandi n'omuntu we owaashukirweho amajuta ni kareebi w'okuhamya, ku mutaine ki mwanshanga omu ngaro. Baagira bati: Niwe kareebi.<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 6:26">Kur 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:20">Zab 77:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Samueli yaagira abantu ati: MUKAMA niwe yaataireho Musa na Arooni, akaiha baashwenkuriimwe omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:3">Isa 5:3</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:2">Mik 6:2</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 6:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 5:11">Bar 5:11</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo eri izooba nimwemerere, ntongane naimwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA eby'okujuna byona ebi MUKAMA yaabakoreire na baashwenkuriimwe. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Yakobo obu yaaza Misri, baashwenkuriimwe bakatakira MUKAMA, yaatuma Musa na Arooni, baiha baashwenkuriimwe Misri, baabata omu nsi egi kutuuramu. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Kwonka baayebwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, yaabarekurira Sisera, omukuru w'eihe rya Hazori, n'Abafilistia, n'omugabe wa Moabu, baabarwanisa. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Bwanyima baatakira MUKAMA nibagira bati: Tukacumura, ahakuba tukaimuura MUKAMA, twaheereza Baabaali n'aba Ashitaroosi; mbwenu otujune, otwihe omu mikono y'abazigu baitu, tukuheereze. <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />MUKAMA yaatuma Yerubabaali, Baraki, Yefusa na Samueli, yaabaiha omu mikono y'abazigu baanyu embaju zoona, mwatuura buhooro. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 8:23">Bar 8:23</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ku mwareebire Nahashi omugabe w'Abaamoni yaabateera, mwangira muti: Ngaaha, nitwenda kutegyekwa omugabe; haza kunu omugabe waanyu ari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:11">Hos 13:11</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati, nimureebe omugabe ou mwayetooraniire, kandi ou mwashabire. Mpaho MUKAMA abateereireho omugabe w'okubategyeka. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:12">Bir 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 81:13">Zab 81:13</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:12">Mub 8:12</ref>. </char></note> Ku muritiina MUKAMA, mwamuheereza, mwahurira eiraka rye, mutaagomera kiragiro kya MUKAMA, kandi imwe n'omugabe orikubategyeka ku murikuratira MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, biryaba gye. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:15">Bir 28:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:20">Yos 24:20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku muryanga kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA, mwagomera ekiragiro kye, omukono gwa MUKAMA guryabarwanisa, nk'oku gwarwaniise baashwenkuriimwe.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati mwemerere mureebe ekintu eki ekikuru eki MUKAMA yaaza kukora omu maisho gaanyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:16">Yak 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 8:7">1 Sam 8:7</ref>. </char></note> Hati t'obunaku bw'eishaaruura ry'engano? Mbwenu naaza kushaba MUKAMA, areete okuhinda kw'enkuba n'enjura; haza mwetegyereze mureebe obubi bwanyu ku buri bwingi, obu mwagizire omu maisho ga MUKAMA, obu mwayeshabira omugabe. <verse eid="1SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Atyo Samueli yaashaba MUKAMA; eryo izooba MUKAMA yaareeta okuhinda kw'enkuba n'enjura; abantu boona baatiina munonga MUKAMA na Samueli. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:28">Kur 9:28</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:24">Byak 8:24</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:15">Yak 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Baagira Samueli bati: Shabira abairu baawe ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, turekye kufa; ahabw'okuba tukongyera aha bibi byaitu byona ekibi eki eky'okweshabira omugabe.<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samueli yaagambira abantu ati: Mutatiina; n'ekya buzima, ebyo bibi byona kwo mukabikora; kwonka mutateishuka mukareka kukuratira MUKAMA, kureka mumuheereze n'omutima gwanyu gwona; <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />kandi mutateishuka mukakuratira ebitaine mugasho, kandi ebitarikubaasa kubagasira, n'obu kwakuba okubajuna; ahakuba tibiine mutambo. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:8">Zab 106:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:16">Yoh 15:16</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu MUKAMA taritsigaho bantu be ahabw'eiziina rye erikuru, ahakuba MUKAMA akasiima kubagira eihanga rye ahabwe. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:5">Byak 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:9">Kol 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:36">1 Bag 8:36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ahabwangye nikikabure okucumura ahari MUKAMA, okureka kubashabira; kureka ndyaguma mbahabure omuhanda murungi kandi oguhikire. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:12">Zab 116:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mugume mutiine MUKAMA, mumuheereze omu mazima n'omutima gwanyu gwona; ahabw'okuba mushemereire kuteekateeka aha bi MUKAMA yaabakoreire ku biri bikuru. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:36">Bir 28:36</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku muriguma nimukora kubi, muryahwerekyerera imwe n'omugabe waanyu.<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Engamba za Saulo n'Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Saulo akaza aha ngoma aine emyaka makumi ashatu, yaamara emyaka ebiri naategyeka Israeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Bwanyima Saulo yaatoorana abashaija enkumi ishatu omu Baisraeli; enkumi ibiri zaaguma na Saulo Mikimaashi n'aha kibungo kya Beseeli; kandi orukumi rwaguma na Yonasaani omuri Gibea eya Benyamiini; abandi boona yaabaraga, buri muntu yaataaha omu ka ye. <verse eid="1SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Bwanyima Yonasaani yaateera ekigo ky'Abafilistia ekyabaire kiri Gibea; Abafilistia baakimanya. Bwanyima Saulo yaaragiira kuteera enzamba omu nsi yoona, naagira ati: Abaheburaayo bahurire. <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 34:30">Kut 34:30</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli boona baahurira ngu Saulo ateire ekigo ky'Abafilistia, kandi ngu Abaisraeli bahindukire ekirikunugwa aha Bafilistia. Abantu baahuruzibwa kushanga Saulo Gilugaali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Kandi Abafilistia baayeteerana kurwanisa Abaisraeli, baine ebigaari obukumi bushatu, n'ab'aha mbaraasi enkumi mukaaga, n'ezindi ngabo nyingi, eziri nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja; bainamuka, baasiisira Mikimaashi, aha burugwa-izooba bwa Besaveeni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:2">Bar 6:2</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija ba Israeli ku baareebire bari omu kabi, (ahakuba abantu bakaba batuntuziibwe) baayeshereka omu nyanga n'omu bishaka n'omu nkiri n'omu nengo kandi n'omu biina. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Kandi Abaheburaayo abamwe bakaba bambukire Yorudani, nibaza omu nsi ya Gaadi na Gileadi; kwonka Saulo akaba akiri Gilugaali, abantu boona baamukuratayo nibatetema.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurahukiriza kwa Saulo n'okushobya kwe kw'okubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:8">1 Sam 10:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo yaamarayo ebiro mushanju, ebi Samueli yaabaire amuragiire; kwonka Samueli tiyaija; n'ahabw'ekyo abantu baatandika kutaataana nibamurugaho mporampora. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:22">1 Sam 15:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:16">2 Bus 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:4">Heb 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Saulo nikwo kugira ati: Mundeetere ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. Atyo yaatamba ekyo kitambo ky'okwotsya. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Ku yaabaire yaaheza ati kukitamba, Samueli yaija. Saulo yaashohora kumubugana, ngu amuramutsye. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samueli yaamubuuza ati: Eki waakora ki? Saulo yaamugarukamu ati: Ku ndeebire abantu baatandika kutaataana nibampwaho, naiwe otaizira mu biro bi ongambiire, kandi n'Abafilistia baateeraniire Mikimaashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />naanye nikwo kugira nti: Hati Abafilistia baaza kushuuma, banteerere Gilugaali, ntakeeshengyereize MUKAMA kumpa omugisha. Nikyo nyegyemeserereize kutamba ekitambo ky'okwotsya. <verse eid="1SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:7-9">2 Sam 12:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:9">2 Bus 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:11">1 Sam 15:11</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaagambira Saulo ati: Waakora eky'obushema; tiwaakwata kiragiro kya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, eki yaakuragiire; reeba MUKAMA yaaba ari ow'okuhamya obugabe bwawe omuri Israeli ebiro byona. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:30">1 Sam 2:30</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:15">2 Sam 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:22">Byak 13:22</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mbwenu obugabe bwawe tiburigumaho. MUKAMA yaaheza kwesherurira omuntu ori nk'omutima gwe oku gurikwenda, kandi niwe yaataho kuba omugabe w'abantu be, ahakuba tokwatsire ki MUKAMA yaakuragiire. <verse eid="1SA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Samueli yaimuka, yaaruga Gilugaali, yaaza Gibea eya Benyamiini. Saulo yaabara abantu abu yaabaire aine, baaba nka magana mukaaga. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani n'abantu abu baabaire baine baaguma Geeba eya Benyamiini; kwonka Abafilistia baaguma omu rusiisira Mikimaashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Kandi abanyagi b'omu Bafilistia baaruga omu rusiisira rwabo, baayecwamu emitwe eshatu; ogumwe gwatoora omuhanda ogurikuza Ofura omu nsi ya Shuali; <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />ogundi gwatoora omuhanda ogurikuza Besi-horoni; n'ogundi gwatoora omuhanda ogw'aha mwatano ogurikureeba omu ruhanga rwa Zeboimu haihi n'eihamba.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:14">2 Bag 24:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo hakaba hatariho muheesi n'omwe omu nsi ya Israeli; ahabw'okuba Abafilistia bakagira bati: Abaheburaayo batakaayeheeshera zaarurara n'amacumu. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Kandi Abaisraeli boona bakaba bashuuma omu Bafilistia, buri muntu kutyazayo efuka ye, oruhabyo rwe, empango ye, n'omuhoro gwe; <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />kwonka bakaba baine eityazo ry'okutyazaho emihoro n'empabyo, n'efuka z'amaino n'empango, n'eby'okutyazaho ebihosho. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:8">Bar 5:8</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo aha izooba ry'orugamba omu bantu abu Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani baabaire baine, tihariho n'omwe owaabaire agira rurara nari eicumu; kureka bikaba bigirwa Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Bwanyima ab'omu kigo ky'Abafilistia baashohora, baaza omu nkiro ya Mikimaashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yonasaani okubinga Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Eizooba rimwe Yonasaani mwene Saulo akagambira omutsigazi, omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye ati: Ija twambukye seeri omu kigo ky'Abafilistia. Kwonka tiyaagambira ishe. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Kandi Saulo akaba ari omu kicweka kya Gibea ekirikuheererukayo ahansi y'omukoma-mahanga ogwabaire guri Migirooni; n'abashaija abu yaabaire aine bakaba bari nka magana mukaaga; <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />kandi hakaba hariho na Ahiya, mwene Ahitubu, mukuru wa Ikabodi, mwene Finehaasi, mwijukuru wa Eli, omunyamurwa wa MUKAMA omuri Shiilo, ajwaire efodi. Kandi n'abo bantu tibaramanyire ku Yonasaani agyenzire.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Omuri egyo nkiro ahu Yonasaani yaabaire naayenda kucwekanisiza kuhika omu kigo ky'Abafilistia, hakaba hariho ebibaare bihango embaju zombi; ekimwe nikyetwa Bozezi, n'ekindi nikyetwa Senehi. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Ekibaare kimwe kikaba kirumbaire aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, ahashungaine na Mikimaashi; n'ekindi aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo ahashungaine na Geeba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 7:4">Bar 7:4</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 7:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 14:11">2 Bus 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:6">Zek 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yonasaani yaagambira ogwo mutsigazi omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye ati: Ija twambukye omuri kiriya kigo kyabatashazirwe; obundi MUKAMA akaagira eki yaatukorera, ahakuba tihariho kirikubaasa kuzibira MUKAMA kujuna, okujunisa baingi nari bakye. <verse eid="1SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye yaamugarukamu ati: Kora ekikuri aha mutima kyona. Reeba ndi hamwe naiwe; oku omutima gwawe guri, n'ogwangye nikwo guri. <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonasaani yaagira ati: Ka twambukye omuri abo bashaija, tubeeyorekye. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Ku baraatugire ngu, mube murekire, okuhitsya obu turaabashangye aho, obwo nitwija kuguma twemereire omu mwanya gwaitu; titurikwija kwinamuka ei bari. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:14">Kur 24:14</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:11">Bar 7:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:24">2 Sam 5:24</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku baraagire ngu, mwinamukye mwije, obwo nitwija kwinamuka; biri MUKAMA naaba abahaireyo omu mikono yaitu. Ako niko karaatubeere akamanyiso. <verse eid="1SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Batyo bombi baayeyoreka ab'omu kigo ky'Abafilistia; Abafilistia ku baabareebire, baagira bati; Reeba, Abaheburaayo nibaruga omu biina omu babaire beesherekire. <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Ab'omu kigo baagambira Yonasaani n'omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye bati: Nimwinamukye, tuboorekye. Yonasaani yaagira omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye ati: Nkurata; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA yaabahayo omu mikono y'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Atyo Yonasaani yaatemba naayajura, n'omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye amuri enyima. Abafilistia baagwa omu maisho ga Yonasaani; kandi omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye yaabaita amukuratiire. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Omuri okwo kwita kw'okubanza Yonasaani n'omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye bakaita abashaija nka makumi abiri omu mwanya ogurikwingana ekicweka ky'omusiri. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:21">Bar 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 7:7">2 Bag 7:7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima haabaho obwoba bwingi omu rusiisira, omu ishwa n'omu bantu boona; kandi ab'omu kigo n'abanyagi bari nabo baatetema; n'ensi yaatengyeta; haabaho okutengyeta kwingi munonga.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Kandi abarinzi ba Saulo, abaabaire bari Gibea eya Benyamiini, ku baanagireyo amaisho, baareeba emitwe y'abantu neegaba ebirari. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Saulo nikwo kugambira abantu abu yaabaire aine ati; Mubare abantu, mureebe ku haraabe haine oturugiremu. Ku baaherize kubara, baashanga Yonasaani n'omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye batabarimu. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Saulo yaagira Ahiya ati: Reeta eshanduukye ya Ruhanga; ahabw'okuba omuri ebyo biro eshanduukye ya Ruhanga ekaba eri omu Baisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Saulo, ku yaabaire naakigamba n'omunyamurwa, orwari orwabaire ruri omu rusiisira rw'Abafilistia rwaguma nirweyongyera; Saulo yaagira omunyamurwa ati: Ihayo omukono gwawe. <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:22">Bar 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:23">2 Bus 20:23</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Saulo n'abantu boona abu yaabaire aine, baayeteerana, baaza omu rugamba; baashanga nibaitana bonka na rurara, buri muntu na mugyenzi we; haabaho omurabanamu muhango munonga. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Kandi Abaheburaayo, abaabaire bari hamwe n'Abafilistia obunyakare, abaagyenzire nabo omu rusiisira, nabo baagarukira Abaisraeli abaabaire bari hamwe na Saulo na Yonasaani, baakwatanisa nabo. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Kandi n'Abaisraeli boona abaabaire beesherekire omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, ku baahuriire ngu Abafilistia baahunga, baababinga babahambize. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:29">Bir 33:29</ref>. </char></note> Atyo MUKAMA yaajuna Abaisraeli eryo izooba; bwanyima orugamba rwagumizamu, rwahika seeri ya Besaveeni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo okurahiza abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 11:30">Bar 11:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba Abaisraeli baaruha munonga, ahabw'okuba Saulo akaba arahiize abantu naagira ati: Omuntu weena oraagire eki yaarya butakahikire mu mwabazyo, kandi ntakahoire bazigu bangye, akyeenwe. N'ahabw'ekyo tihaagira n'omwe owaagira eki yaatamira. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:8">Kur 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona baahika aha kibira ekyabaire kirimu obwoki ahansi; <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />ku baakitaahiremu, baashanga obwoki nibushononoka; kwonka tihaagira owaayekoza orukumu omu kanwa; ahakuba bakaba nibatiina egyo ndahiro. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Kwonka Yonasaani we, obu ishe yaabaire naarahiza abantu, taramuhuriire. N'ahabw'ekyo yaihayo enkoni ei yaabaire akwaitse omu ngaro, yaacumita eifundo ryayo omu ngabo y'obwoki, yaakoza orukumu rwe omu kanwa, amaisho ge gaahweza. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Omwe ahari abo bantu yaamugira ati: Sho yaarahiriza kimwe abantu, naagira ati: Omuntu weena oraagire eki yaatamira eri izooba akyeenwe. Kandi abantu bakaba nibagwa enshazi. <verse eid="1SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonasaani yaagira ati: Taata ka yaakabya ensi; mbwenu nimureebe amaisho gangye ku gaahweza ahabw'okurigatsa ahari aka kooki. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Kuri noogira ngu abantu eri izooba baikirizibwa kurya aha minyago y'abazigu baabo, ei bashangireyo, tibaakubaire gye okukiraho? Ahakuba tihakabaireho kwita kwingi omu Bafilistia.<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Eryo izooba baabinga Abafilistia okuruga Mikimaashi okuhika Ayalooni. Abantu baagwa enshazi munonga; <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Kut 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10">Lev 17:10</ref>. </char></note> baayeroha omu minyago, baakwata entaama n'ente n'enyana, baaziregyeza ahansi; baaziriirirana n'eshagama yaazo. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Haabaho abaabigambira Saulo bati: Reeba, abantu nibacumura ahari MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba nibarya enyama n'eshagama yaayo. Yaabagira ati: Mwagobya; mbwenu mukumbagaze eibaare rihango, murindeetere aha. <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Bwanyima Saulo yaagira ati: Murabe omu bantu boona, mubagire muti: Buri muntu areete ente ye, nari entaama ye, muziitire aha, muzirye; kandi mutacumura ahari MUKAMA, mukarya eshagama. Ekyo kiro buri muntu yaareeta ente ye, baaziitira aho. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:17">1 Sam 7:17</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaayombekyera MUKAMA eitambiro; eryo niryo itambiro ry'okubanza eri yaayombekyeire MUKAMA.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abantu okwiha Yonasaani omu mikono ya Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 4:8">Yak 4:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Saulo yaagira ati: Mwije tushuume, tukurate Abafilistia eki kiro, tubanyagye okuhitsya omu kasheeshe; tutagira omuntu n'omwe ou twatsigaho. Abantu baagira bati: Kora kyona eki orikusiima. Bwanyima omunyamurwa yaabagira ati: Mwije aha, twirire haihi Ruhanga. <verse eid="1SA 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:6">1 Sam 28:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 66:18">Zab 66:18</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaayehanuuza ahari Ruhanga naagira ati: Nshuume nkurate Abafilistia? Noija kubahayo omu mikono y'Abaisraeli? Kwonka MUKAMA tiyaamugarukamu ekyo kiro. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:14">Yos 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Saulo nikwo kugira ati: Imwe mwena abakuru b'abantu, nimwirire aha, mwetegyereze mureebe eki kibi kyakorwa eri izooba ahu kiri; <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />ahakuba nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, Omujuni wa Israeli, n'obu kyakuba kiri omuri mutabani wangye Yonasaani, buzimazima naija kwitwa. Kwonka tihaabaho n'omwe omu bantu boona owaamugarukamu. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Bwanyima yaagambira Abaisraeli boona ati: Muze aha rubaju rumwe, nyowe na mutabani wangye Yonasaani tuze aha rundi. Abantu baagarukamu Saulo bati: Kora eki orikusiima. <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />N'ahabw'ekyo Saulo yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, ahabw'enki tiwaagarukamu omwiru waawe eri izooba? Ku ruraabe ruri orubanja rwangye nari orwa mutabani wangye Yonasaani, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, oyorekye ekihikire; kwonka ku ruraabe ruri orw'abantu baawe Israeli, otuhe Tumimu. Haakwatwa Yonasaani na Saulo, abantu baakira. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Saulo yaagaruka yaagira ati: Teera enteenyu ahariinye na mutabani wangye Yonasaani. Enteenyu yaakwata Yonasaani.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Saulo nikwo kugira Yonasaani ati: Ngambira eki waakora. Yonasaani yaamugira ati: N'ekya buzima naakoza eifundo ry'enkoni, ei naaba nyine omu ngaro, omu bwoki, naarigatsaho. Reeba ndi aha, nshemereire kufa. <verse eid="1SA 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Saulo yaagira ati: Yonasaani, buzimazima noija kufa; ku oraabe otafiire, Ruhanga akinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="1SA 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Kwonka abantu baagira Saulo bati: Hoona Yonasaani, oreetsire okujunwa okurikwingana kuti omuri Israeli, afe? Nikikabure! Niturahira MUKAMA otahwaho, tiharikwija kugira kashokye na kamwe ak'aha mutwe gwe akaagwa ahansi; ahabw'okuba eri izooba yaakora na Ruhanga. Okwo nikwo abantu baakirize Yonasaani, atafe. <verse eid="1SA 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Okuruga aho Saulo yaarekyeraho kukurata Abafilistia; n'Abafilistia baagaruka owaabo.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Saulo ku yaaherize kuza aha ngoma omuri Israeli, yaarwana n'abazigu be boona embaju zoona, Abamoabu, Abaamoni, Abanyaedomu, abagabe ba Zooba n'Abafilistia; ahu yaabaire aza hoona, abasingura. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3">1 Sam 15:3</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Yaarwana n'obumanzi, yaasingura Abaamaleki, yaiha Abaisraeli omu mikono y'abaabaire babanyagire.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:49: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 31:2">1 Sam 31:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi beene Saulo bakaba bari aba: Yonasaani, Ishivi, na Malikishua; n'aga nigo gaabaire gari amaziina ga bahara be bombi: ow'okubanza akaba ari Merabu, n'omurumuna ari Mikaali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Eiziina rya muka Saulo akaba naayetwa Ahinoamu, muhara wa Ahimaazi; eiziina ry'omukuru w'engabo ze akaba naayetwa Abuneeri, mutabani wa Neeri, ishento wa Saulo; <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kiishi akaba ari ishe wa Saulo, na Neeri, ishe wa Abuneeri, akaba ari mwene Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:11">1 Sam 8:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro bya Saulo byona hakabaho okurwana kw'amaani n'Abafilistia; n'ahabw'ekyo Saulo ku yaabaire areeba omuntu weena ow'amaani nari emanzi, amutwara, aba omushaija we.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Saulo okuragiirwa kucwekyereza Abaamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Kandi Samueli akagira Saulo ati: MUKAMA akantuma kukushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli; n'ahabw'ekyo hati hurira ebi MUKAMA arikukugambira. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8">Kur 17:8</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Nyijukire oku Abaamaleki baagizire Abaisraeli, obu baabatanga omu muhanda nibaruga Misri. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Kur 20:5</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu irooko orwanise Abaamaleki, ocwekyerereze kimwe ebi baine byona, otabasaasira, kureka oite abashaija n'abakazi, abeereere n'abarikwonka, ente n'entaama, engamira n'endogoya. <verse eid="1SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Saulo yaayeta abantu, yaababarira Telaimu, abarikugyendesa ebigyere baaba obusiriira bubiri, n'Abayuda baaba kakumi. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Saulo yaahika aha rurembo rw'Abaamaleki, yaabagwera omu ruhanga. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:21">Kub 24:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:10">Kur 18:10</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 10:29-32">Kub 10:29-32</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:25">18:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:4">Kush 18:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Saulo yaagira aba Keeni ati: Mushuume murugye omu Baamaleki, ntakaabacwekyereza nabo; ahabw'okuba mukagirira Abaisraeli boona embabazi, obu baabaire nibaruga Misri. N'ahabw'ekyo aba Keeni baaruga omu Baamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Saulo yaabinga Abaamaleki okuruga Havila okuhika Shuuri, ahashungaine na Misri; <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:34">1 Bag 20:34</ref>; <ref loc="EST 3:1">Est 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 30:1">1 Sam 30:1</ref>. </char></note> yaakwata Agagi omugabe w'Abaamaleki ahuriire, kandi yaacwekyerereza kimwe abantu boona na rurara. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:10">1 Tim 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Saulo n'abantu baasaasira Agagi n'entaama n'ente n'abaana b'entaama ebirikukira oburungi kandi ebigomokire, n'ebintu byona ebirungi; tibaabicwekyerereza kimwe; kwonka byona ebirikugaywa kandi ebitaine mugasho baabicwekyerereza kimwe.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samueli okugambira Saulo ekifubiro kye ahabw'okutahurira MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Samueli nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:6">Kut 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1">1 Sam 16:1</ref>. </char></note> Niinyefuuza eki naateereireho Saulo kuba omugabe; ahabw'okuba agarukire enyima, yaayanga kunkuratira, kandi tiyaakora bi naamuragiire. Samueli yaaguubwa kubi; yaaraara naatakira MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samueli yaaguruka kare omu kasheeshe kubugana Saulo. Baamugira bati: Saulo ahikire Karumeeli, yaayebyarirayo eibaare ry'ekiijutsyo, yaakuba yaagumizamu, yaashuuma Gilugaali. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:11">Luk 18:11</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaija ahari Saulo; Saulo yaamugira ati: MUKAMA akuhe omugisha! Nkozire eki MUKAMA andagiire. <verse eid="1SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samueli yaamubuuza ati: Beitu shi, okwo kujuga kw'entaama n'okw'ente oku ndikuhurira n'okw'enki? <verse eid="1SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:12">Kut 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 28:13">Enf 28:13</ref>. </char></note> Onu ati: N'ezi baihire omu Baamaleki; ahakuba abantu basaasiire entaama n'ente ezirikukira oburungi, kuzitambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ebitambo; ebindi ebitsigaireho tubicwekyerereize kimwe. <verse eid="1SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samueli yaagira Saulo ati: Ba orekire, nkugambire eki MUKAMA araire angambiire. Onu ati: Gamba.<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samueli yaagira ati: N'obu oraabe waabaire nooyegaya ngu ori muto, toratoorainwe kuba omutegyeki w'enganda za Israeli? Omanye ku MUKAMA niwe yaakushukireho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Mbwenu akutumire naagira ati: Gyenda ocwekyerereze kimwe abasiisi Abaamaleki, orwane nabo okuhitsya obu oraabamareho. <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />N'enki ekikuzibiire kworobera eiraka rya MUKAMA, okagwa aha minyago n'enda, okakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA? <verse eid="1SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Saulo yaagira Samueli ati: Okworoba kwo nyorobeire MUKAMA, naaza ei MUKAMA antumire, naareeta Agagi omugabe w'Abaamaleki, kandi naacwekyerereza kimwe Abaamaleki; <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />kwonka abantu batwaire eminyago y'entaama n'ente, ebirikukira oburungi omu bibaire biri eby'okucwekyerezibwa, kubitambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe omuri Gilugaali. <verse eid="1SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 21:3">Enf 21:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:22">Yer 7:22</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:6">Mik 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:33">Mak 12:33</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaamugarukamu ati: Noogira ngu MUKAMA naashemerererwa ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo, nk'oku ashemerererwa okworobera eiraka rye? Manya okworoba kukira ebitambo, n'okuhurira kukira ebishaju by'empaya z'entaama. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kwonka obugomi ni nk'ekibi ky'oburogo, n'obugangaazi ni nk'okuramya ebishushani na baateraafi. Nk'oku oyangire ekigambo kya MUKAMA, nawe ayangire ku oguma aha ngoma.<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:13">2 Sam 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 29:25">Enf 29:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:12">Isa 51:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:8">Kush 21:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo yaagira Samueli ati: Ncumwire; ahabw'okuba nsiisire ekiragiro kya MUKAMA n'ebigambo byawe ahabw'okutiina abantu n'okuboorobera. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, nsaasira ekibi kyangye, oikirize ogyende naanye, mbone kuramya MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:30">1 Sam 2:30</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaagira Saulo ati: Tindikwija kugarukayo naiwe, ahabw'okuba oyangire ekigambo kya MUKAMA; nawe yaayanga ku oba omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samueli ku yaabaire naakihinduka kugyenda, Saulo yaakwata omukugiro gw'ekijwaro kye, kyataaguka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:17">1 Sam 28:17</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaamugira ati: Eri izooba MUKAMA yaakutaaguraho obugabe bwa Israeli, yaabuha mutaahi waawe orikukukira oburungi. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Kub 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:2">Tit 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Maani ga Israeli tabeiha, n'obu kwakuba okwegarukamu; ahabw'okuba ti muntu ngu ayegarukyemu. <verse eid="1SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:6">Kut 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:13">Yak 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:6">Kush 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:40">1 Bag 18:40</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Saulo yaagira ati: Ncumwire; kwonka hati ninkweshengyereza mpa ekitiinisa omu maisho g'abakuru b'abantu bangye n'omu maisho ga Israeli yoona, ogyende naanye, mbone kuramya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Atyo Samueli yaahinduka, yaakurata Saulo; Saulo yaaramya MUKAMA.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Bwanyima Samueli yaagira ati: Mundeetere aha Agagi, omugabe w'Abaamaleki. Agagi yaija ahu ari naanyimbanyimba; yaagira ati: Buzimazima obushaarizi bw'okufa bwahweire. <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samueli yaagira ati: Nk'oku rurara yaawe yaahindwire abakazi encwekye, nikwo na nyoko yaaza kuhinduka encwekye omu bakazi. Samueli yaatemagurira Agagi omu maisho ga MUKAMA Gilugaali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Bwanyima Samueli yaaza Raama, na Saulo yainamuka yaaza owe Gibea eya Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Okuruga obwo Samueli tiyaagaruka kwija kureeba Saulo okuhitsya obu yaafire; kwonka yaaguma naamusaasibwa; kandi MUKAMA yaayefuuza eki yaahinduriire Saulo omugabe wa Israeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samueli okutoorana Daudi n'okumushukaho amajuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagira Samueli ati: Noija kuhitsya hi okusaasibwa Saulo, haza nyowe mmwangire kuba omugabe wa Israeli? Ijuza eihembe ryawe amajuta, oije nkutume ahari Yese owa Betelehemu; ahakuba nyeboneire omugabe omu batabani. <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:1-3">2 Bag 9:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaagira ati: Nimbaasa nta kugyenda? Saulo ku araakihurire, naija kuunyita. MUKAMA yaagira Samueli ati: Twara enyana y'eruutsi; ku oraahikyeyo, ogire oti: Nyizire kutambira MUKAMA ekitambo. <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Kandi oyete na Yese aije ahari okwo kutamba; naanye niinyija kukworeka oku oraatwaze, onshukire amajuta ahari ogwo ou ndaakugambire. <verse eid="1SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samueli yaakora nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiira, yaaza Betelehemu. Ku yaahikireyo, abakuru b'orwo rurembo baija kumubugana nibatetema; baamubuuza bati: Beitu waahuutwa ki? Ni buhooro? <verse eid="1SA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:10">Kur 19:10</ref>. </char></note> Nawe yaabagira ati: Ni buhooro. Nyizire kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo. Mweyeze, mwije tugyendane aha kitambo. Kandi yaayeza Yese n'abatabani, nabo yaabeeta kwija aha kitambo.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Ku baizire, yaareeba Eliabu, yaateekateeka ati: Buzimazima ou MUKAMA arikwenda kushukaho amajuta niwe ogu ori omu maisho ge. <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:10">Zab 147:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:7">2 Kor 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:39">1 Bag 8:39</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Yer 17:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA yaagira Samueli ati: Otareeba oku arikushusha nari ekyemerero kye; ahakuba ogwo tiwe ndikwenda; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA tareeba nk'oku abantu bareeba; abantu bareeba emireebekyere y'aharuguru, kwonka MUKAMA areeba omutima. <verse eid="1SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Bwanyima Yese yaayeta Abinadabu, yaamurabya omu maisho ga Samueli. Samueli yaagira ati: N'ogu tiwe MUKAMA atooraine. <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese yaagaruka yaarabyaho Shaama. Nabwo Samueli yaagira ati: N'ogu nawe tiwe MUKAMA atooraine. <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Atyo Yese yaarabyaho abatabani, baahika mushanju omu maisho ga Samueli; Samueli yaamugira ati: Omuri aba tiharimu u MUKAMA atooraine. <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:8">2 Sam 7:8</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaabuuza Yese ati: Abaana baawe boona bari aha? Yaamugarukamu ati: Haatsigarayo omuto, kwonka ariisize entaama. Samueli yaagira Yese ati: Tuma bamureete; ahakuba titurikwija kushutama atakahikire aha. <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="SNG 5:10">Kyesh 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 9:17">1 Sam 9:17</ref>. </char></note> Yaatuma, baamureeta. Omwana ogwo akaba naayera, aine ahamaisho harungi, kandi ari murungi omu kureebwa. MUKAMA yaagira ati: Imuka omushukyeho amajuta; niwe ogu. <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:20">Zab 89:20</ref>. </char></note> Samueli yaakwata eihembe ry'amajuta, yaagamushukiraho omu maisho g'abakuru be; okwiha obwo Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaija ahari Daudi n'amaani, yaamugumaho. Bwanyima Samueli yaimuka, yaagaruka Raama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo okugiibwaho omwoyo mubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 18:12">1 Sam 18:12</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 16:20">Bar 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:11">Zab 51:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo Omwoyo wa MUKAMA akaba arugire ahari Saulo, kandi omwoyo mubi ogwarugire ahari MUKAMA gwaguma nigumwita kubi. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Abaheereza ba Saulo baamugira bati: Reeba omwoyo mubi ogurugire ahari Ruhanga nigukwita kubi. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Mukama waitu, ragiira abairu baawe abakuri omu maisho, bakusherurire omuntu orikumanya kuteera gye enanga; bwanyima omwoyo mubi ogurikuruga ahari Ruhanga ku guraagume gwakwijaho, agikuteerere, obe gye. <verse eid="1SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Saulo nikwo kugambira abaheereza be ati: Munsherurire omuntu orikumanya kuteera gye enanga, mumundeetere. <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Omutsigazi omwe yaamugira ati: Nyowe ndeebire mutabani wa Yese owa Betelehemu, naamanya kuteera gye enanga, n'omushaija w'amaani emanzi, orikumanya eby'okurwana, otarikugambira eryo, omuntu murungi omu kureebwa; kandi MUKAMA ari hamwe nawe. <verse eid="1SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />N'ahabw'ekyo Saulo yaatuma ahari Yese naagira ati: Nyoherereza mutabani waawe Daudi, omuriisa w'entaama. <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese yaareeta endogoya, yaagyekoreza emigaati n'efureebe ya viinyo, n'omwana gw'embuzi, yaabitwekyera Saulo, byatwarwa Daudi omutabani. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daudi ku yaahikire Saulo, yaatandika kumuheereza; Saulo yaamukunda munonga, yaamugira omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Saulo yaagaruka yaatuma ahari Yese ati: Ninkushaba oikirize Daudi agume nampeereza; ahabw'okuba atungire obuganzi ahariinye. <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Okuruga aho, omwoyo mubi ogwarugire ahari Ruhanga ku gwabaire gwija ahari Saulo, Daudi akwata enanga, agiteera; Saulo aikaikana, aba gye, ogwo mwoyo mubi gumurugaho.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okwita Goliasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Omu bunaku obwo Abafilistia bakateerana engabo zaabo kurwana; baateeranira Sooko eya Yuda, baateera orusiisira Efesi-damimu, ahagati ya Sooko na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Saulo n'Abaisraeli nabo baateerana, baateera orusiisira omu ruhanga rwa Ela, baatenga orugamba kurwana n'Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Abafilistia baayemerera aha kibungo seeri, n'Abaisraeli baayemerera seenu aha kindi; oruhanga rubari ahagati. <verse eid="1SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:19">2 Sam 21:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 11:22">Yos 11:22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omu rusiisira rw'Abafilistia haarugamu emanzi rugambwa, orikwetwa Goliasi owa Gaasi; oburaingwa bwe bukaba buri mikono mukaaga n'ekita; <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />akaba ajwaire enkofiira y'omuringa aha mutwe, n'eky'okujwara ky'ekyoma, oburemeezi bwakyo shekeli z'omuringa enkumi itaano; <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />aha maguru ajwaireho ebyoma by'okukingira emirundi, aine akacumu k'omuringa ahagati y'amabega ge; <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:19">2 Sam 21:19</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 11:23">1 Bus 11:23</ref>. </char></note> orubango rw'eicumu rye ruri nk'empimbi ei barukiraho emyenda; okuremeera kw'ekyogi kyaryo ziri shekeli z'ekyoma magana mukaaga, kandi omukwatsi w'engabo ye amwebembeire. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Yaija yaayemerera, yaagambira amahe ga Israeli n'eiraka rihango, ati: Mbwenu mweruhiize ki kwija kutenga orugamba? Tindi Omufilistia? Naimwe timuri engabo za Saulo? Mwetooranire omushaija, ashuume tubugaabugane. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Ku arandwanise, yaanyita, nitwija kuba abairu baanyu; kwonka ku ndamusingure, naamwita, naimwe nimwija kuba abairu baitu, nimutukorera. <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:7">Kub 23:7</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 23:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Omufilistia yaagaruka yaagira ati: Nimpiga amahe ga Israeli eri izooba; nimumpe omushaija, turwane. <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Saulo n'Abaisraeli boona ku baahuriire ebigambo by'ogwo Mufilistia, baahahaara, baatiina munonga.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 4:22">Rus 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1">1 Sam 16:1</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 16:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 16:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Daudi akaba ari omwana w'Omunyefuraata owa Betelehemu-Yuda, orikwetwa Yese; omushaija ogwo akaba aine abatabani munaana; omu biro bya Saulo akaba ari omugurusi, yaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Abatabani abakuru bashatu bakaba bahurwire na Saulo; amaziina g'abo batabani bonshatu gakaba gari aga; ow'omujigaijo Eliabu, ow'omushubiro Abinadabu, n'owa kashatu Shaama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daudi akaba ari muto waabo boona, kandi bakuru be abo bonshatu nibo baabaire bahurwire na Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Kwonka Daudi akaba aza owa Saulo, kandi agaruka Betelehemu kuriisa entaama za ishe. <verse eid="1SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kandi ogwo Mufilistia akaba aija buri kasheeshe na buri mwabazyo, abeeringiita omu maisho, okumara ebiro makumi ana.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Eizooba rimwe Yese akagira Daudi omutabani ati: Irooko ogyemurire bakuru baawe eefa y'engano zikarangire n'egi migaati ikumi, obibatwarire juba omu rusiisira; <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:14">Kut 37:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi ezi ncumate ikumi za ciizi ozitwarire omukuru w'engabo rukumi ezi barimu; oreebe bakuru baawe oku bari, haza ondeetere amakuru agarikubarugaho.<verse eid="1SA 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Omu bunaku obwo Saulo n'abo bashaija n'Abaisraeli boona bakaba bari omu ruhita rwa Ela nibarwana n'Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Daudi yaaguruka kare omu kasheeshe, entaama yaazitsigira omurinzi, yaakwata ebyo bintu, yaagyenda nk'oku Yese amuragiire; yaahikira ahu baabaire beemereize ebigaari, yaashanga engabo nizihiga, nizishohora kurwana. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Abaisraeli n'Abafilistia baatenga orugamba, engabo zaasyamirana n'ezindi. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi yaakwatsa omurinzi w'eby'orugamba ebintu bye, yairuka, yaayeroha omu ngabo, yaahika bakuru be, yaabaramutsya. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Ku yaabaire naakigaaniira nabo, egyo manzi rugambwa, Omufilistia wa Gaasi orikwetwa Goliasi, yaasyoka omu ngabo z'Abafilistia, yaatandika kuhiga nk'oku abaire naahiga; Daudi yaabihurira. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Abaisraeli boona, ku baareebire ogwo mushaija, baamuhunga; baatiina munonga. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:16">Yos 15:16</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baagira bati: Ebyo ogwo mushaija waasyokayo mwamureeba? Buzimazima yaija kuhiga Israeli; omuntu oraamwite, omugabe naija kumutungisa munonga, amuhingire muhara we, kandi ahe omuryango gwa ishe obusingye omuri Israeli. <verse eid="1SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:10">Yer 10:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Daudi yaabuuza abashaija abaabaire bamwemereire aha rubaju ati: Oraite ogwo Mufilistia, yaiha aha Baisraeli ekijumo, naija kukorerwa ki? Beitu shi, oriya Mufilistia otashazirwe niwe oha kwehanga kuhiga amahe ga Ruhanga ohuriire? <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Abantu baamugarukamu nk'ebi ab'okubanza baagamba, bati: Oraamwite nikwo araakorewe atyo.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:4">Kut 37:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 18:19">Enf 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 27:4">27:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Eliabu mukuru wa Daudi yaahurira naagamba n'abo bashaija; yaamugirira ekiniga, yaamubuuza ati: Waashuumibwa ki kunu? Obutaama buri waabutsigira oha omu ihamba? Nimmanya amaryo gaawe n'obutigi bw'omu mutima gwawe; waareetwa okureeba orugamba. <verse eid="1SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:1">Enf 15:1</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaamugarukamu ati: Mbwenu naashobya ki? Noogira ngu tiinyine kyandeeta? <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Yaamuteera amabega, yaahindukira ondiijo, nawe yaamubuuza nk'ebyo; abantu baamugarukamu nk'okubanza.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Abantu ku baahuriire ebi Daudi yaagamba, baagaruka baabigambira omu maisho ga Saulo; Saulo yaamutuma. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:3">Bir 20:3</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira Saulo ati: Hatagira owaahahaaza omutima ahabw'ogwo Mufilistia; omwiru waawe yaaza kurwana nawe. <verse eid="1SA 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:31">Kub 13:31</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaagira Daudi ati: Torikubaasa kuturukirira ogwo Mufilistia kurwana nawe, ahabw'okuba okiri muto, kandi we n'omushaija omanyiire engamba okwiha omu buto. <verse eid="1SA 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Daudi yaagarukamu Saulo ati: Nyowe, omwiru waawe, nkaba ndiisa entaama za tata; ku haabaire haija entare nari edubu, yaakwata omwana gw'entaama omu busyo, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />nkaba ngikurata, ngiteera, ngugiiha omu kanwa; ekinyijaijana, ngikwata akareju, ngiteera, ngiita. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Omwiru waawe akaita entare n'edubu; n'Omufilistia ogwo otashazirwe naija kuba nk'emwe aharizo, ahabw'okuba ahigire amahe ga Ruhanga ohuriire. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:10">2 Kor 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:17">2 Tim 4:17</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagaruka yaagira ati: MUKAMA owaanyihire omu byara by'entare n'omu byara by'edubu, naija kunjuna n'omu mikono y'ogwo Mufilistia. Saulo yaagira Daudi ati: Irooko, MUKAMA agume naiwe.<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Bwanyima Saulo yaihayo ebijwaro bye eby'okurwanisa, yaabijweka Daudi; yaamuta enkofiira y'omuringa aha mutwe, yaamujweka ekooti y'ekyoma; <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daudi yaahagatirira rurara ahari ebyo bijwaro. Yaateeraho kugyenda, byayanga; ahakuba akaba atabimanyiire. Daudi yaagira Saulo ati: Tindikubaasa kugyenda njwaire ebi; ahakuba timbimanyiire. Atyo Daudi yaabijuura. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Yaakwata enkoni ye omu ngaro, yaayetooranira amabaare ataano omu kagyera, yaagata omu kashaho k'omunda ak'omu furebe y'omuriisa ei yaabaire aine; kandi akaba aine enjungu ye omu ngaro; yairira haihi Omufilistia.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Omufilistia nawe yaija, yairira haihi Daudi, omukwatsi w'engabo ye amwebembeire. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:27">1 Kor 1:27</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 1:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Omufilistia ku yaizire naamagamaga, yaareeba Daudi, yaamugaya; ahakuba akaba ari omutsigazi muto, orikwera, oine ahamaisho harungi. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Omufilistia yaagira Daudi ati: Obu orikumpururira n'enkoni, onyetsire embwa? Yaamukyeenesa baaruhanga be. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:10">1 Bag 20:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 20:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:23">Yer 9:23</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Ija nkubaagire amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba. <verse eid="1SA 17:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:8">2 Bus 32:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 124:8">Zab 124:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:4">2 Kor 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:13">Fil 4:13</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira Omufilistia ati: Wampururira na rurara n'eicumu n'akacumu; kwonka nyowe naija omu iziina rya MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga w'engabo za Israeli, ezi ohigire. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:36">1 Bag 18:36</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:19">2 Bag 19:19</ref>. </char></note> Eri izooba MUKAMA naakuhayo omu mikono yangye, ninkuteera, noogwa, ninkucwaho omutwe; kandi eri izooba niinyija kugaburira amahungu g'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba emitumbi y'engabo z'Abafilistia, haza ensi yoona neemanya ku habaho Ruhanga omuri Israeli, <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:7">Hos 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:6">Zek 4:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'omutwe gwona oguri aha nigumanya ku MUKAMA atajunisa rurara na icumu; ahabw'okuba orugamba oru n'orwa MUKAMA, kandi naija kubahayo omu mikono yaitu.<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Omufilistia ku yaarugire ahu yaabaire ari, yaija kubugaabugana na Daudi, Daudi yaija nairuka agyemire ahu baabaire batengire orugamba kubugaabugana n'ogwo Mufilistia. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Yaata omukono gwe omu furebe, yaihamu eibaare, yaarirekyera, yaariteera Omufilistia omu buso, ryahweramu, yaagwa ajuumaire. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:31">Bar 3:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 15:15">15:15</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Daudi yaasingwize Omufilistia eibaare ry'enjungu, akamuteera, akamwita; kwonka Daudi akaba ataine rurara mu ngaro. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:9">1 Sam 21:9</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yairuka, yaaza aha Mufilistia, yaamwemereraho, yaakwata rurara ye, yaagisyora omu kyobati kyayo, yaagimwitsa, yaamucwaho omutwe. Abafilistia ku baareebire emanzi yaabo yaafa, baahunga. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Abaisraeli n'Abayuda baimuka, baateera akaari, baabinga Abafilistia okuhika Gaasi n'aha marembo ga Ekurooni; emputa z'Abafilistia zaagyenda nizigwa aha muhanda ogurikuruga Sharaimu okuhika Gaasi na Ekurooni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Bwanyima Abaisraeli baarekyera aho kubinga Abafilistia, baagaruka, baanyaga orusiisira rwabo. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi yaatwara omutwe gw'Omufilistia, yaaguhitsya Yerusaalemu; kwonka eby'okurwanisa bye yaabita omu ihema rye.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:21">1 Sam 16:21</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 16:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo ku yaareebire Daudi naaza kurwana n'Omufilistia, yaabuuza Abuneeri omukuru w'engabo ze ati: Abuneeri, hari oriya mwojo ni mwene oha? Abuneeri yaamugarukamu ati: Buso bwawe, Nyakusinga, tindikumumanya. <verse eid="1SA 17:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Omugabe yaagira ati: Irooko obuuririze ishe w'ogu mwojo. <verse eid="1SA 17:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Kandi Daudi ku yaatabaarukire ati naaruga kwita Omufilistia, Abuneeri yaamutwara omu maisho ga Saulo, aine omutwe gw'Omufilistia omu ngaro. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaamubuuza ati: Ori mwene oha, mutsigazi 'we? Daudi yaagarukamu ati: Ndi mwene Yese omwiru waawe owa Betelehemu.<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Omukago gwa Daudi na Yonasaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 1:26">2 Sam 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 18:24">Enf 18:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi ku yaaherize kugamba na Saulo, omutima gwa Yonasaani gwanywana n'ogwa Daudi; Yonasaani yaamukunda nk'oku ayekunda. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:15">1 Sam 17:15</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba Saulo yaatwara Daudi owe, tiyaamwikiriza bundi kugaruka owa ishe. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Bwanyima Yonasaani yaaragaana na Daudi endagaano, ahakuba akamukunda nk'oku ayekunda. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonasaani yaayejuura omunagiro ogu yaabaire ajwaire, yaaguha Daudi, n'eby'okurwanisa bye, nangwa na rurara ye n'obuta bwe n'orukoba rwe nabyo yaabimuha. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Daudi akaba aza ei Saulo yaabaire amutuma yoona; kandi akoresa obwengye. N'ahabw'ekyo Saulo yaamugira omukuru w'engabo ze, abantu boona baakisiima, nangwa n'abagaragwa ba Saulo baakisiima.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhimbisibwa kwa Daudi n'eihari rya Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:20">Kur 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:34">Bar 11:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibatabaaruka, Daudi aherize kwita ogwo Mufilistia, abakazi baaruga omu ndembo za Israeli zoona, baija kubugana Saulo nibeeshongora, nibaguruka, baine ebitaasa n'enanga z'emirya eshatu, nibashemererwa. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Omu kweshongora, abo bakazi baikirizana nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">Saulo aitsire enkumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">Daudi yaita obukumi.<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 4:4">Mub 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo yaagira ekiniga kingi, ekyo kigambo kyamugwisa kubi; yaagira ati: Daudi baamubarira obukumi, nyowe bambarira enkumi zonka. Mbwenu shi ekindi atsigariire ki? T'okuza aha ngoma? <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Okuruga obwo Saulo yaaguma naareeba Daudi eriisho ribi. <verse eid="1SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:14">1 Sam 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 19:24">19:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, omwoyo mubi ogwarugire ahari Ruhanga gwaza ahari Saulo n'amaani, yaasharira omu nju ye; obwo Daudi akaba naateera enanga nk'obutoosha; kandi Saulo akaba aine eicumu omu ngaro. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:10">1 Sam 19:10</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 20:33">20:33</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaarirekyera; ahakuba akateekateeka ati: Niinyija kucumita Daudi, eicumu ryogyemu rikwate ekisiika. Daudi yaamweshumba kabiri.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:13">1 Sam 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:15">28:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo yaatiina Daudi, ahakuba MUKAMA akaba ari hamwe nawe, arugire ahari Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:2">2 Sam 5:2</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Saulo yaamweihiireho, akamugira omukuru w'omutwe gw'engabo rukumi, Daudi akaguma naazeebembera omu kuhurura, kandi naatabaaruka nazo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:2">Kut 39:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:27">Yos 6:27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Daudi yaaguma naakoresa obwengye omu mitwarize ye yoona; MUKAMA yaaguma nawe. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Saulo ku yaareebire aine obwengye bwingi omu mitwarize ye, yaamutiina. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Kwonka Abaisraeli n'Abayuda boona baamukunda, ahakuba akaba abeebembera omu kuhurura, kandi n'omu kutabaaruka.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo okuhingira Daudi muhara we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 17:25">1 Sam 17:25</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:9">2 Sam 12:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba rimwe Saulo akagambira Daudi ati: Reeba, muhara wangye omukuru Merabu ngugu; niinyija kumukuhingira; kwonka ogume ombeere emanzi, orwane engamba za MUKAMA. Ahakuba Saulo akaba naateekateeka ati: Ndekye kuba niinye naamwita, kureka aitwe Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:18">2 Sam 7:18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:33">Enf 15:33</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira Saulo ati: Mbwenu nyowe niinye oha, n'abaitu nibo baahi, n'omuryango gwa taata omuri Israeli nigwo guuha, nyowe okuba mukwe w'omugabe? <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:8">2 Sam 21:8</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka obunaku ku bwahikire, Merabu muhara wa Saulo, owaabaire ari ow'okuhingirwa Daudi, baamuhingira Adurieli owa Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Bwanyima Mikaali muhara wa Saulo yaarigira Daudi; ku baakigambiire Saulo, kyamushemeza; <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:24-26">Enf 26:24-26</ref>. </char></note> yaagira ati: Niinyija kumumuha, amubeere omutego, Abafilistia bamurwanise. Nikyo Saulo yaagiriire Daudi obwa kabiri, ati: Mbwenu hati noija kuba mukwe wangye. <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Saulo nikwo kugambira abagaragwa be ati: Mugaaniire na Daudi omu mubonano, mumugire muti: Manya, omugabe naakusiima munonga, n'abagaragwa be boona nibakukunda; n'ahabw'ekyo ikiriza obe mukwe w'omugabe. <verse eid="1SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Abagaragwa ba Saulo baagambira Daudi ebyo bigambo. Daudi yaagira ati: Imwe nimukyeta ekintu kikye okuba mukwe w'omugabe; haza ndi omwana w'omworo, kandi otaine kitiinisa? <verse eid="1SA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Bwanyima abagaragwa ba Saulo baamugambira oku Daudi agizire. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Saulo yaagira ati: Oku mube nikwo mwagira Daudi muti: Omugabe tarikwenda njugano, kureka ebishushu igana ebishazirwe aha Bafilistia, abone kuhoora abazigu be. Kwonka Saulo akateekateeka atyo, ngu amwitse Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Abagaragwa be ku baaherize kugambira Daudi ebyo bigambo, Daudi yaasiima munonga kuba mukwe w'omugabe. <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:14">2 Sam 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Ebiro ku byabaire bitakahingwireho, Daudi yaimuka n'engabo ze, baahurura, baita Abafilistia magana abiri; Daudi yaatabaaruka n'ebyo bishushu byabo, baabitwarira omugabe byona, ngu abone kuba mukwe w'omugabe. Atyo Saulo yaamuhingira muhara we Mikaali. <verse eid="1SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Kwonka Saulo ku yaabireebire, yaamanya ku MUKAMA ari hamwe na Daudi, kandi ku Abaisraeli boona barikumukunda, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:12">Zab 37:12</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 37:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 4:4">Mub 4:4</ref>. </char></note> yaayeyongyera kumutiina. Okuruga aho Saulo yaaguma ari omuzigu wa Daudi ebiro byona. <verse eid="1SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Bwanyima abategyeki b'Abafilistia baahurura kubarwanisa; ku baabaire bahurura, Daudi arwana gye okukira abagaragwa ba Saulo boona; n'ahabw'ekyo eiziina rye ryarangaanwa.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yonasaani okweshengyereza Saulo kutaita Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 27:4">Enf 27:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Saulo yaagambira omutabani Yonasaani n'abagaragwa be boona kwita Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Kwonka Yonasaani mwene Saulo akaba naakunda Daudi munonga; mbwenu Yonasaani yaagira Daudi ati: Tata Saulo naayenda kukwita; n'ahabw'ekyo omu kasheeshe oyerinde, oyesherekye omu mwanya gwekiikire, ogumeyo; <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />naanye niinyija kushohora, nyemerere aha rubaju rwa taata omu ishwa ahu oraabe ori, ngaaniire nawe aha byawe; ku ndaagire eki naareeba, niinyija kukikugambira. <verse eid="1SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:5">Zab 109:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 17:13">Enf 17:13</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, Yonasaani yaagamba gye Daudi ahari Saulo ishe, naamugira ati: Nyakusinga, otakora ekibi aha mwiru waawe Daudi, ahabw'okuba takakucumurahoga, kureka ebi akukorera byona ni birungi; <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 12:3">Bar 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 20:32">1 Sam 20:32</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba akooga amagara, yaita Omufilistia, MUKAMA yaaha Abaisraeli boona obusinguzi buhango. Naiwe okakireeba, waakishemerererwa. Mbwenu ahabw'enki nooyenda kukora kubi kusheesha eshagama y'otaine rubanja, kwitira Daudi busha? <verse eid="1SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Saulo yaahurira ebi Yonasaani yaamugambira, yaarahira naagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, tariitwa. <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Yonasaani yaayeta Daudi, yaamugambira ebyo byona; bwanyima Yonasaani yaagarura Daudi ahari Saulo, yaaguma omu maisho ge nk'obunyakare.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo okugaruka kuhiiga Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Haagaruka haabaho obweme; Daudi yaahurura, yaarwanisa Abafilistia, yaabaitamu abantu baingi munonga; baamuhunga. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:10">1 Sam 18:10</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba rimwe Saulo akaba ashutami omu nju ye, aine eicumu omu ngaro, Daudi naamuteerera enanga; omwoyo mubi ogwarugire ahari MUKAMA gwamwijaho; <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Saulo yaateeraho kucumita Daudi eicumu, ngu rimuhamize aha kisiika; kwonka Daudi yaaryeshumba, ryacumita ekisiika; Daudi yaacwa, yaahunga. <verse eid="1SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Ekyo kiro Saulo yaatuma entumwa owa Daudi kuraara bamugwereire, ngu bamwite omu kasheeshe; Mikaali muka Daudi yaamugambira naagira ati: Ku oraabe otakirize magara gaawe eki kiro, nyencakare noija kwitwa. <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:15">Yos 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:24">Byak 9:24</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:32">2 Kor 11:32</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 11:33">33</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Mikaali yaarabya Daudi omu dirisa, yaacwa, yaahunga. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikaali yaiha ekishushani kya teraafi omu mwanya gwakyo, yaakita aha kitanda, yaakishegura omushego gw'obwoshe bw'embuzi, yaakishweka emyenda. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Saulo ku yaatumire entumwa kukwata Daudi, Mikaali yaagira ati: Arwaire. <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Bwanyima yaagaruka yaatuma entumwa kureeba Daudi, naagira ati: Mumuheekye aha kitanda, mumundeetere, mmwite. <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Entumwa ku zaataahire omu nju, zaashanga ekishushani kya teraafi omu kitanda kishegwire omushego gw'obwoshe bw'embuzi. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Saulo ku yaabimanyire, yaagira Mikaali ati: Ombeihiire ki otyo, okareka omuzigu wangye, akacwa, akagyenda. Mikaali yaagarukamu Saulo ati: Angizire ati: Reka ngyende; mbwenu nkwitire ki?<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Daudi yaacwa, yaahunga, yaashanga Samueli Raama, yaamuteekyerereza oku Saulo amugizire kwona. Yaimuka na Samueli, baaza Nayosi, baagumayo. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Bwanyima baagambira Saulo ku Daudi ari Nayosi omuri Raama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:32">Yoh 7:32</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 7:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:5">1 Sam 10:5</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 10:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Saulo yaatuma entumwa kukwata Daudi; ku zaareebire omutwe gwa baanabi nibaragura, na Samueli ayemereire aho nk'omukuru waabo, Omwoyo wa Ruhanga yaaza aha ntumwa za Saulo, nazo zaaragura. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Ku baakigambiire Saulo, yaatuma ezindi ntumwa, nazo zaaragura. Yaagaruka yaatuma ezindi obwa kashatu, nazo zaaragura. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Bwanyima yaayeimukira, yaaza Raama, yaahika aha iziba rihango rya Seeku, yaabuuza ati: Samueli na Daudi barahi? Baamugarukamu bati: Reeba, bari Nayosi omuri Raama. <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:24">Kut 31:24</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:10">1 Sam 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13:2</ref>. </char></note> Saulo nikwo kwimuka, akaza Nayosi omuri Raama; ku yaabaire naakigyenda, Omwoyo wa Ruhanga yaamwijaho, yaagyenda naaragura, okuhitsya obu yaahikire Nayosi omuri Raama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:2">Isa 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:8">Mik 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Nawe yaajuura ebijwaro bye, yaaragurira omu maisho ga Samueli, yaamara eryo izooba ryona n'ekyo kiro kyona, arambiire ajwaire busha. Nikyo kigirirwa kiti: Saulo nawe ari omuri baanabi?<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yonasaani okweshengyerereza Daudi ahari Saulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Daudi yaahunga, yaaruga Nayosi omuri Raama, yaija ahari Yonasaani, yaamubuuza ati: Beitu nkozire ki? Nsiisire ki? Ncumwire ki ahari sho, eki arikumpiigira kuunyita? <verse eid="1SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Nawe yaamugarukamu ati: Nikikabure! Torikwija kufa. Reeba, taata takora kintu kyona, yaaba kihango nari kikye, atakingambiire. Noogira ngu eki taata akaakinsherekyeire ki? Tikwo kiri. <verse eid="1SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Daudi yaarahira naagira ati: Sho naamanya gye ku onkunda, nikwo kugira ati: Ka Yonasaani arekye kubimanya, akashaasha; kwonka buzima ninkurahira Ruhanga otahwaho, magara gaawe, ntsigaizeyo orutambwe rumwe nfe. <verse eid="1SA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonasaani yaagira Daudi ati: Eki omutima gwawe gurikwenda kyona, niinyija kukikukorera. <verse eid="1SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11">Kub 28:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 19:2">1 Sam 19:2</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira Yonasaani ati: Reeba, nyencakare okwezi nikuboneka; nkaabaire ntashemereire kubura aha by'okurya by'omugabe; kwonka mbwenu ndeka, ngyende nyesherekye omu kishaka okuhitsya aha kiro kya kashatu omu mwabazyo. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Sho ku araabe atandeebire, omugire oti: Daudi anyeshengyereize munonga ngu mmurekye ahikyeho owaabo Betelehemu; ahabw'okuba hariyo obugyenyi bw'ebitambo ebitambirwa eka yaabo yoona buri mwaka. <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Ku araagire ati: Ni kirungi, biri omwiru waawe yaaba gye; kwonka ku araaguubwe kubi, noija kumanya ku amaririire kunkora kubi. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:3">1 Sam 18:3</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 14:32">2 Sam 14:32</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo girira omwiru waawe embabazi; ahakuba okaragaana n'omwiru waawe endagaano ya MUKAMA; kwonka ku ndaabe nyine eki nsiisire, onyeitire; nooyendera ki kuntwara ahari sho? <verse eid="1SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonasaani yaagira ati: Nikikabure! Kuri noogira ngu mbaire nimmanya ku taata amaririire kukukora kubi, tinkukugambiire? <verse eid="1SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Daudi yaabuuza ati: Beitu shi, sho ku araakugarukyemu kubi, n'oha orangambire? <verse eid="1SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonasaani yaagira Daudi ati: Ija tushohore, tuze omu ishwa. Baashohora, baaza omu ishwa.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonasaani yaagira Daudi ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli niwe kareebi. Nyencakare nk'aga magingo, nari kwosha nyencakare, ku ndaaheze kugaaniira na taata, nimmukyenguuza, naashanga akwineho ebiteekateeko birungi, niinyija kukutumaho, mbikumanyise. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Kwonka ku ndaashangye taata naayenda kukukora kubi, ntaabikugambira, nkakuraga, okeegyendera n'obusingye, MUKAMA akinture n'okukiraho. Mbwenu MUKAMA agume naiwe, nk'oku yaabaire aba na taata. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ku ndiba nkiriho, ogume ongirire embabazi nk'eza MUKAMA, ndekye kufa; <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:23">Kut 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 9:1-7">2 Sam 9:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 21:7">21:7</ref>. </char></note> kandi otarireka kugirira eka yangye embabazi ebiro byona. MUKAMA ku ariba naamaraho abazigu ba Daudi omu nsi, <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:2">1 Sam 31:2</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 4:7">2 Sam 4:7</ref>. </char></note> otariikiriza eiziina rya Yonasaani kumarwaho omu nju ya Daudi. MUKAMA ahoore enzigu abazigu ba Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:2">1 Sam 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 1:26">2 Sam 1:26</ref>. </char></note> Yonasaani yaagaruka yaarahiza Daudi ahabwa rukundo ei yaabaire naamukunda; ahabw'okuba akaba naamukunda, nk'oku yaabaire naayekunda.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Bwanyima Yonasaani yaamugira ati: Nyencakare okwezi nikuboneka; nibaija kukusherura, obure, ahakuba omwanya gwawe nigwija kuba gurimu busha. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Aha kiro kya kashatu oshuume, ogarukye omu mwanya ogu waabaire oyesherekiremu, obu biri byabaho, ogume haihi n'eibaare rya ezeli. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Ku ndaije, niinyija kurasha emyambi eshatu aha rubaju rwaryo, nk'orikurasha ekimaasho. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Bir 6:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, niinyija kutuma omwojo, mmugire nti: Irooko osherure emyambi. Ku ndaagire ogwo mwojo nti: Reeba, emyambi eri aha rubaju rwawe orurikuhera kunu, giiheho; haza iwe obwo oije, ahakuba nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, ahariiwe nihaba hariho obusingye, hatariho kabi. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Kwonka ku ndaagire omwojo nti: Reeba, emyambi eri ahabiso yaawe; obwo oyegyendere; biri MUKAMA niwe yaakwohereza. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kandi aha bigambo ebi ebi twagamba hamwe, reeba, MUKAMA niwe araagume ahagati yangye naiwe ebiro byona.<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 27:12">Enf 27:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Daudi yaayeshereka omu ishwa. Okwezi ku kwabonekire, omugabe yaashutama kurya; <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />yaashutama aha kitebe kye haihi n'ekisiika nk'obutoosha, Yonasaani yaashutama aha rundi rubaju rw'emeeza nibareebana, Abuneeri yaashutama aha rubaju rwa Saulo, kwonka omwanya gwa Daudi gwagumamu busha. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:16">Kub 19:16</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba Saulo tiyaagira ki yaagamba, ahakuba akateekateeka ati: Shana hariho ekimubaireho; tashemeire; buzimazima tashemeire. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Kandi ku bwaseesire, okwezi kuraire kubonekire, nabwo omwanya gwa Daudi gwagumamu busha. Saulo yaabuuza omutabani Yonasaani ati: N'enki ekizibiire mwene Yese kwija aha by'okurya nyomwabazyo n'eri izooba? <verse eid="1SA 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonasaani yaamugarukamu ati: Daudi anyeshengyereize munonga kumwikiriza kuza Betelehemu, <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />naagira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, reka ngyende; ahabw'okuba owaitu nibaija kutamba ebitambo omu rurembo, kandi mukuru wangye andagiire kubayo. N'ahabw'ekyo ku oraabe nongirira embabazi, reka ngyende, nze kureeba bakuru bangye. Ekyo nikyo kimuzibiire kwija aha meeza y'omugabe.<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Ahonaaho Saulo yaagirira Yonasaani ekiniga kingi, yaamugira ati: Iwe omwana w'omukazi entahurira kandi omugomi, tindikumanya ku waatooraine mwene Yese kwehemura, n'okuhemura nyoko, okamukwatsa enshoni? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Omanye ngu mutabani wa Yese ku ariba akiri omuri egi nsi, torihamibwa n'obu bwakuba obugabe bwawe. N'ahabw'ekyo tuma bamundeetere; ahabw'okuba buzimazima naija kufa. <verse eid="1SA 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:5">1 Sam 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:23">Mat 27:23</ref>. </char></note> Yonasaani yaamugarukamu, ati: Beitu naitirwa ki? Acumwire ki? <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Ahonaaho Saulo yaamurekyera eicumu kumwita; Yonasaani yaamanyira aho ku ishe amaririire kwita Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Yonasaani yaimuka, yaaruga aha meeza n'ekiniga kingi, yaayanga kurya eby'okurya ahari ekyo kiro kya kabiri ky'okwezi, ahabw'okuba akaguubwa kubi ahabwa Daudi, kandi n'ahabwa ishe kumuhemura. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Omu kasheeshe Yonasaani yaashohora, yaaza omu ishwa n'omwojo omu bunaku obu aragaaniise Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Yaagira ogwo mwojo we ati: Iruka otorotoore emyambi ei naaza kurasha. Omwojo ku yaabaire nairuka, onu yaarasha omwambi, yaagumurenzya. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Omwojo ku yaahikire ahu omwambi ogu Yonasaani yaarasha gwagwa, Yonasaani yaayeta omwojo, naagira ati: Omwambi tiguri ahabiso yaawe? <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Yonasaani yaagaruka yaagambira omwojo ati: Rahuka, gira obwira, oteeziringa. Atyo omwojo wa Yonasaani yaatorotoora emyambi, yaagaruka ahari mukama we. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Kwonka ogwo mwojo taine ki yaamanyire, kureka Yonasaani na Daudi nibo baakimanyire. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonasaani yaaha omwojo we eby'okurwanisa bye, yaamugira ati: Irooko obitware omu rurembo. <verse eid="1SA 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Omwojo ku yaabaire yaarugaho ati, Daudi yaimuka, yaaruga aha rubaju rw'eibaare riri, yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara, yaamwinamira kashatu; bwanyima baanywegyerana, bombi baarira, okuhitsya obu Daudi yaarengyesereize. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Bwanyima Yonasaani yaagira Daudi ati: Yegyendere n'obusingye; ahakuba twembi tukarahirana omu iziina rya MUKAMA nitugira tuti: MUKAMA aryaguma ahagati yangye naiwe, kandi n'ahagati y'oruzaaro rwangye n'orwawe ebiro byona. Daudi yaimuka yaagyenda; Yonasaani yaagaruka omu rurembo.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okurya emigaati y'okumurikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Bwanyima Daudi yaaza Noobu owa Ahimeleki omunyamurwa; Ahimeleki yaija kumubugana naatetema, yaamubuuza ati: Ahabw'enki ori wenka, otaine muntu? <verse eid="1SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:20-24">Kut 27:20-24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:18">1 Bag 13:18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 29:25">Enf 29:25</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:12">Gal 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 2:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagarukamu Ahimeleki omunyamurwa ati: Omugabe aine eki yandagiira kukora; kandi yangira ati: Hatagira owaamanya eki naakutuma kukora, n'eki naakuragiira; kandi ndagaine n'engabo zangye z'abatsigazi ku tubugaabugana omu mwanya nanka. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Mbwenu oine eki oine? Mpa emigaati etaano nari ekindi kyona eki oine. <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:30">Kur 25:30</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa yaagarukamu Daudi ati: Tiinyine mugaati gw'obutoosha, kureka hariho omugaati ogweziibwe, ogu ndikubaasa kubaha, abatsigazi ku baraabe beerinzire abakazi. <verse eid="1SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:4">1 Tes 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagarukamu omunyamurwa naagira ati: Buzimazima tumazire ebiro bishatu tuzibiirwe kuhika abakazi; nyimukize orugyendo, ebintu by'abatsigazi bangye biri ebirikwera, n'obu ruraabe rubaire ruri orugyendo rw'obutoosha; mbwenu shi eri izooba tibirikukiraho kuba ebirikwera? <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:3">Mat 12:3</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:8">Lev 24:8</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omunyamurwa yaamuha emigaati eyeziibwe; ahakuba hakaba hatariho gundi mugaati, kureka emigaati ey'okumurikwa, eihirwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA, bakagaruraho emigaati eyaaruga kuteekwa.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:9">1 Sam 22:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eryo izooba hakaba hariho omwe aha bagaragwa ba Saulo, owaabaire aine ekimutsigaize omu maisho ga MUKAMA, eiziina rye Doegi Omunyaedomu, omukuru w'abashumba ba Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Bwanyima Daudi yaabuuza Ahimeleki ati: Beitu shi aha tokaagiraho icumu nari rurara? Ahakuba tindeetsire rurara yangye n'obu byakuba eby'okurwanisa byangye; ahabw'okuba omurimo gw'omugabe gubaire nigwenda obwira. <verse eid="1SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:51">1 Sam 17:51</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa yaagira ati: Rurara eri eya Goliasi Omufilistia, ou waitiire omu ruhita rwa Ela, reeba ngigi; eri aha enyima ya efodi, eshembire omu mwenda; ku oraayende kugitwara, ogitware; ahakuba tihariho ndiijo eri aha kureka egyo. Daudi yaagira ati: Tihariho erikushushana nayo; gimpe.<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Eryo izooba Daudi yaimuka, yaahungira owa Akishi omugabe wa Gaasi ahabw'okutiina Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1 Sam 18:7</ref>. </char></note> Abagaragwa ba Akishi baamugira bati: Ogu tiwe Daudi omugabe w'eihanga? Tibaramweshongoire omu kuzina kwabo nibaikirizana bati: Saulo aitsire enkumi; Daudi yaita obukumi? <verse eid="1SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daudi ku yaahuriire ebyo bigambo, yaabita aha mutima, yaatiina munonga Akishi omugabe wa Gaasi. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />N'ahabw'ekyo yaayehindura omu maisho gaabo, yaayegwisiza eiraro omu mikono yaabo, yaaguma naaharamba enyigi z'eirembo, naitururuka orufuzi niruza omu bireju. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi yaagira abagaragwa be ati: Yeimwe, timurikureeba ogu mushaija ku agwire eiraro? Mumundeetereire ki? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Nimugira ngu nkyenire abagwa-iraro, mwaza kundeetera eki kishaija kunsharira omu maisho? Eki kishaija nikiija kungiira omuka?<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okuhungira omu nyanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 23:13">2 Sam 23:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaarugayo, yaahungira omu nyanga ya Adulaamu; beene waabo n'ab'omu ka ya ishe boona ku baakihuriire, baashuuma, baamushangayo. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Omuntu weena owaabaire ari omu naku, n'owaabaire aine amabanja, n'owaabaire aine eki arikwetomboita, baateeranira ah'ari; yaaba omukuru waabo; kandi abaamweteeraniireho baahika abantu nka magana ana.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kur 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:1">Enf 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2">Efe 6:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaarugayo, yaaza Mizipe omuri Moabu; yaagira omugabe wa Moabu ati: Ninkweshengyereza, oikirize tata na maawe bafurukire kunu, batuure naiwe, okuhitsya ahu ndaamanyire eki Ruhanga arankorere. <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Yaabatsigira omugabe wa Moabu, baaguma nawe ebiro byona ebi Daudi yaamazire omu kigo. <verse eid="1SA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:11">2 Sam 24:11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima nabi Gaadi yaagira Daudi ati: Reka kuguma omu kigo; rugamu oze omu nsi ya Yuda. Daudi nikwo kurugayo, akaza omu kibira kya Heresi.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo okwita abanyamurwa naabatura okuhwera Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Eizooba rimwe Saulo akaba ashutami Gibea ahansi y'omunyinya omuri Raama, aine eicumu omu ngaro, n'abagaragwa be boona beemereire bamwehinguririize. Yaahurira ku Daudi abonekire n'abashaija abu yaabaire aine. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Saulo yaabuuza abagaragwa be abamwehinguririize ati: Imwe Babenyamiini 'mwe, nimuhurire! Hari nimugira ngu mwene Yese ogwo naija kuha buri muntu omuriimwe emisiri n'emizaabibu, kandi mwena nikwo aribagira abakuru b'engabo rukumi-rukumi n'ab'eigana-igana, <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:21">1 Sam 23:21</ref>. </char></note> mwaza kuza omu naama kungomera? Tihariho n'omwe orikummanyisa ku mutabani wangye ari omu naama na mwene Yese; kandi tihariho n'omwe omuriimwe orikunsaasibwa, nari orikummanyisa ku mutabani wangye angomeseize omugaragwa kundwanisa, akangwera, nk'oku angwereire hati. <verse eid="1SA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1">1 Sam 21:1</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 21:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Doegi Omunyaedomu, owaabaire ayemereire aha rubaju rw'abagaragwa ba Saulo, yaagira ati: Ndeebire mwene Yese naija Noobu, owa Ahimeleki mwene Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:6">1 Sam 21:6</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 21:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Ahimeleki yaamuhanuuriza ahari MUKAMA, yaamuha eby'okurya, kandi yaamuha rurara ya Goliasi Omufilistia.<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Omugabe ku yaakihuriire, yaatuma Ahimeleki omunyamurwa, mwene Ahitubu, n'ab'enju ya ishe boona, abanyamurwa abaabaire bari Noobu. Boona baija aha mugabe. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Saulo yaagira ati: Hurira, iwe mwene Ahitubu! Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Gamba, Nyakusinga! <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Saulo yaamugira ati: Ahabw'enki iwe na mwene Yese mungiiriire omu naama, okamuha emigaati na rurara, kandi okamuhanuuriza ahari Ruhanga, ngu aimukye kundwanisa, n'okungwera, nk'oku angwereire hati? <verse eid="1SA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:4">1 Sam 19:4</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 19:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Ahimeleki yaagarukamu omugabe ati: Beitu omu bagaragwa baawe boona, n'oha orikwesigwa nka Daudi, mukwe w'omugabe, oshutama omu mibonano y'enaama zaawe, kandi ow'ekitiinisa omu ka yaawe? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Noogira ngu hati nibwo naatandika kumuhanuuriza ahari Ruhanga? Ngaaha! Omugabe arekye kwomesereza omwiru we ekintu kyona, n'obu baakuba ab'enju ya taata boona; ahakuba omwiru waawe taine ki arikumanya ahari ebyo byona, yaaba bingi nari bikye. <verse eid="1SA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Omugabe yaagira ati: Iwe Ahimeleki, okufa kwo noija kufa, n'ab'enju ya sho boona. <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Yaagaruka yaagira abarinzi abaabaire beemereire bamwehinguririize, ati: Muhindukye, mwite abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA, ahakuba nabo bakwataniise na Daudi, kandi bakamanya ku yaahungire, tibaakimmanyisa. Kwonka abagaragwa b'omugabe baayanga kugorora emikono yaabo kwita abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:31">1 Sam 2:31</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira Doegi ati: Hinduka ogurukire abo banyamurwa, obaite. Doegi yaahinduka, yaabagurukira, yaabaita; eryo izooba yaita abantu abaabaire bajwara efodi ya kitaani makumi munaana na bataano. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Bwanyima yaacwekyereza Noobu orurembo rw'abanyamurwa na rurara; abashaija n'abakazi, abaana n'abarikwonka, ente, endogoya n'entaama ebyabaire birimu yaabiitsa rurara.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:6">1 Sam 23:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omwe ahari batabani ba Ahimeleki mwene Ahitubu orikwetwa Abiasaari yaahonokaho, yaahunga, yaakurata Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiasaari yaagambira Daudi ku Saulo aitsire abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Daudi yaagira Abiasaari ati: Buri, obu Doegi Omunyaedomu yaabaire ariyo, nkamanyira kimwe ku arikwija kugambira Saulo. N'ahabw'ekyo ab'eka ya sho boona niinye bazizire. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:26">1 Bag 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yoh 15:20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu guma naanye, otatiina; ahakuba orikumpiiga kuunyita, naiwe niwe arikukuhiiga kukwita; mbwenu obu wampikire, tokifa.<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okujuna aba Keila, bwanyima bakamureebya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Bwanyima baagambira Daudi bati: Reeba Abafilistia nibarwanisa Keila, kandi banyaga engano z'aha mbuga zaabo. <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:19">2 Sam 5:19</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 5:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:5">Enf 3:5</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 3:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:23">Yer 10:23</ref>. </char></note> Daudi nikwo kwehanuuza ahari MUKAMA, naabuuza ati: Mbwenu nze kuteera abo Bafilistia? MUKAMA yaagarukamu Daudi ati: Irooko, obateere, ojune aba Keila. <verse eid="1SA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Kwonka abantu ba Daudi baamubuuza bati: Mbwenu obu twatiina tukiri aha omuri Yuda, ku turiza Keila kurwana n'amahe g'Abafilistia turyaba tuta? <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Daudi yaagaruka yaayehanuuza ahari MUKAMA; MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati: Imuka oshuume Keila; ahakuba niinyija kuhayo Abafilistia omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Daudi yaimuka n'engabo ze, baaza Keila, baarwana n'Abafilistia, baanyaga ente zaabo, baabaitamu abantu baingi munonga. Okwo nikwo Daudi yaajunire aba Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:20">1 Sam 22:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obu Abiasaari mwene Ahimeleki yaahungira ahari Daudi ari Keila, akashuumayo aine efodi omu ngaro. <verse eid="1SA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:4-6">1 Sam 24:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 26:8-9">26:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:11">Zab 71:11</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba rimwe baagambira Saulo ku Daudi ari Keila. Saulo yaagira ati: Ruhanga amuhaireyo omu mikono yangye, ahakuba obu ataahire omu rurembo orwine eirembo ry'enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi, ayekingiraine omunda. <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Saulo yaahuruza engabo ze zoona kushuuma Keila kugota Daudi n'abantu be. <verse eid="1SA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:7">1 Sam 30:7</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaamanya ku Saulo ari omu naama y'okumukora kubi, yaagira Abiasaari omunyamurwa ati: Reeta efodi. <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Daudi yaashaba naagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, nyowe omwiru waawe mpuriire ku Saulo arikwenda kuteera Keila, kugicwekyereza ahabwangye. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Abantu ba Keila nibaija kumpayo omu mikono ye? N'eky'amazima Saulo naija kushuuma kunu, nk'oku omwiru waawe ahuriire? MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, ninkweshengyereza, manyisa omwiru waawe. MUKAMA yaagarukamu ati: Naija kushuuma. <verse eid="1SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi yaagaruka yaabuuza ati: Aba Keila nibaija kumpayo n'abantu bangye omu mikono ya Saulo? MUKAMA yaagarukamu ati: Nibaija kukuhayo. <verse eid="1SA 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:13">1 Sam 25:13</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Daudi n'abantu be nka magana mukaaga baimuka, baaruga Keila, baaza hoona ahu barikubaasa. Bwanyima baagambira Saulo ku Daudi acwire, akaruga Keila, yaareka kuhurura. <verse eid="1SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 11:1">Zab 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:7">Zab 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 3:11">2 Tim 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:17">4:17</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaaguma omu bigo by'omu ihamba, omu nsi y'ebibungo omu ihamba rya Ziifu. Saulo yaaguma naamusherura obutoosha, kwonka Ruhanga tiyaamuhayo mu mikono ye.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi na Yonasaani okugaruka kuragaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Daudi ku yaareebire Saulo aizire kumuhiiga kumwita, yaaguma omu ihamba rya Ziifu omu kibira. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Bwanyima Yonasaani mwene Saulo yaimuka, yaashanga Daudi omuri ekyo kibira, yaamugumya omuri Ruhanga. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:20">1 Sam 24:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Otatiina; ahakuba tata Saulo tarikubona, kandi oryaba omugabe wa Israeli, naanye nkubeho owa kabiri; kandi ekyo na Saulo tata naakimanya. <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:3">1 Sam 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Bombi baaragaana endagaano omu maisho ga MUKAMA. Daudi yaaguma omuri ekyo kibira, Yonasaani yaagaruka owe.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 26:1">1 Sam 26:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo aba Ziifu bainamuka owa Saulo Gibea, baagira bati: Ebyo noomanya ku Daudi ayesherekire omuriitwe omu kibira ky'omu kibungo kya Hakila, ekiri aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bw'eihamba? <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Mbwenu Nyakusinga, shuuma, oyemare ekikuri aha mutima; ekyaitu n'okumuhayo omu mikono y'omugabe. <verse eid="1SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Saulo yaagira ati: MUKAMA abahe omugisha; ahakuba mwangirira esaasi. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Mwirooko, mwongyere kuhamya, mwetegyereze mureebe omwanya ogu ayesherekiremu, kandi mumanye n'omureebire; ahakuba nibangambira omushaija ogwo ku aba omunyabwengye. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo mureebe, mwetegyereze obweshereko bwe bwona, ahu ayesherekire, haza mugarukye mundeetere enkuru ehamire, naanye niinyija kugyenda naimwe; ku araabe ari omuri egyo nsi, niinyija kumusherura omu nkumi zoona ez'Abayuda. <verse eid="1SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Batyo baimuka, baaza Ziifu, baatangayo Saulo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:24">Omu bunaku obwo Daudi n'abashaija be bakaba bari omu ihamba rya Maoni omuri Araba, aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo bwa Yeshimooni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Saulo n'abantu be baaza kumusherura; haabaho abaagambira Daudi; n'ahabw'ekyo yaaza aha ibaare rihango ery'omu ihamba rya Maoni, yaagumayo. Saulo ku yaakihuriire, yaamukurata omuri eryo ihamba. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Saulo yaareetwa aha rubaju rumwe rw'ekibungo, na Daudi n'abantu be aha rundi; obwo Daudi akaba nairuka naahunga Saulo, ahakuba Saulo n'engabo ze bakaba nibenda kubakubira ahagati kubakwata. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">2 Sam 22:1-51</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:6-9">Isa 37:6-9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka haija entumwa ahari Saulo, yaamugira eti: Rahuka ogarukye; ahakuba Abafilistia baahurura kuteera ensi yaitu. <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />N'ahabw'ekyo Saulo yaagarukayo, yaarereera kukurata Daudi, yaaza kurwanisa Abafilistia. Nikyo baayeteire ogwo mwanya Sela-hama-lekoosi. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Bwanyima Daudi yaarugayo, yainamuka, yaaguma omu bigo bya Enigeedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Saulo okugumizamu naahiga Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:28">1 Sam 23:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo ku yaatabaarukire naaruga kubinga Abafilistia, abantu baamugira bati: Reeba, Daudi ari omu ihamba rya Eni-geedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Saulo nikwo kutoorana engabo enkumi ishatu omuri Israeli yoona, akazitwara, akaza kusherura Daudi n'abantu be aha nkiri z'aha izaagiriro ry'enzaza. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Ku yaahikire aha ngombe z'entaama ezaabaire ziri aha rubaju rw'omuhanda, yaashangaho enyanga, yaagitaahamu kuza aha ishaazi. Kandi Daudi n'abashaija be bakaba bari hare omunda y'egyo nyanga. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:8">1 Sam 26:8</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija ba Daudi baamugira bati: Eri niryo izooba eri MUKAMA yaakugambiire naagira ati: Reeba, ndyahayo omuzigu waawe omu mikono yaawe, omugire nk'oku orikwenda. Bwanyima Daudi yaimuka, yaagyenda naashooba, yaashara aha mukugiro gw'omunagiro gwa Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Kwonka ku yaaherize kukora atyo, yaashinjwa omu mutima ahabw'okushara ahari ogwo munagiro; <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:11">1 Sam 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:29">Yob 31:29</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 31:30">30</ref>. </char></note> yaagira abashaija be ati: Nikikabure nyowe okukora ntyo mukama wangye, ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta, okumubangira omukono, haza MUKAMA yaamushukireho amajuta. <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:4">Zab 7:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:17">Rom 12:17</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Daudi yaazibira abashaija be, tiyaabaikiriza kwita Saulo. Bwanyima Saulo yaimuka, yaaruga omu nyanga, yaagyenda.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Bwanyima Daudi nawe yaimuka, yaaruga omu nyanga, yaayeta Saulo naagira ati: Nyakusinga mukama wangye. Saulo ku yaagarwire amaisho enyima, Daudi yainama, yaamutangirira. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Daudi yaabuuza Saulo ati: Ahabw'enki noohurira ebi abantu barikukugambira ngu, Daudi naayenda kukukora kubi? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Mbwenu tiwaayereebera ku MUKAMA yaaba akuhaireyo omu mikono yangye eri izooba, obu waaba ori omu nyanga? Nangwa hariho abamwe abangambira kukwita, kwonka nyowe naakusaasira, naagira nti: Tindikwija kugorora mukono gwangye ahari mukama wangye, ahakuba niwe MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:28">1 Sam 23:28</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Taata, reeba omukugiro gw'omunagiro gwawe; nk'oku naashara omukugiro gw'omunagiro gwawe, ntakwite, ekyo kikumanyise kandi oreebe ku hatariho kibi nari obugomi omuriinye; kandi ku ntakakucumurahoga, n'obu oraabe otuura noohiiga amagara gangye kugaihaho. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:8">Yob 5:8</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA abe niwe yaatucwera orubanja twembi, kandi abe niwe yaakumpoorera; kwonka omukono gwangye gurekye kuba nigwo gwakwita. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Nk'oku enfumu y'aba kare egira eti, Ebibi biruga omu babi; kwonka omukono gwangye tigurikukoraho. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Beitu omugabe wa Israeli aizire kuteera oha? Ou ohiigire n'oha? Ohiigire embwa efiire, ohiigire omura. <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:1">Zab 35:1</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA abe omuramuzi waitu twembi, atucwere orubanja, areebe, antonganire, akunjune. <verse eid="1SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:17">1 Sam 26:17</ref>. </char></note> Daudi ku yaaherize kugambira Saulo ebigambo ebyo, Saulo yaagira ati: Mwana wangye Daudi, eryo n'eiraka ryawe? Saulo yaayeha eboroogo, yaarira. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:27">Kur 9:27</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaagira Daudi ati: Wankiza okuhikiirira; ahakuba waanyihura ebirungi, haza nyowe nkwihwire ebibi. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Kandi eri izooba waayoreka butunu ku wankora gye, ahabw'okuba tiwaanyita n'obu MUKAMA yampayo omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Noogira ngu omuntu akaareeba omuzigu we, amureka, agyenda? N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA akuzimuurire ebirungi ahabw'eki wankorera eri izooba. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23">1 Sam 23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, hati nimmanya ku otaribura kuba omugabe, n'obugabe bwa Israeli ku burihamibwa omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo ndahira MUKAMA ku otaricwekyereza ruzaaro rwangye naarugaho, kandi ku otarimaraho iziina ryangye omu nju ya tata. <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daudi yaamurahira. Saulo yaagaruka owe; kwonka Daudi yainamuka yaagaruka omu kigo n'abantu be.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Samueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 28:3">1 Sam 28:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiro ku byahingwireho, Samueli yaafa; Abaisraeli boona baateeranira hamwe, baamucurira, baamuziika omu nju ye Raama. Bwanyima Daudi yaimuka, yaashuuma, yaaza omu ihamba rya Parani.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Nabali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Omuri Maoni hakaba harimu omushaija, ou amatungo ge gaabaire gari Karumeeli; akaba ari omutungi munonga, aine entaama enkumi ishatu, n'embuzi rukumi; omuri obwo bunaku akaba naakyemurira ebyoya by'entaama ze Karumeeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 31:10">Enf 31:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 32:5">Isa 32:5</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 32:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mushaija akaba naayetwa Nabali, n'eiziina ry'omukazi we ari Abigaili. Ogwo mukazi akaba ari omukazi orikwetegyereza, kandi murungi; kwonka iba akaba ari omunyamwaga, aine emicwe mibi; kandi akaba ari ow'omu muryango gwa Kalebu.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Daudi ku yaabaire akiri omu ihamba, yaahurira ngu Nabali naakyemura ebyoya by'entaama ze. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Daudi yaatuma abatsigazi ikumi, yaabagira ati: Mwinamukye Karumeeli, muze owa Nabali, mumundamukize; <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:12">Mat 10:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:13">13</ref>. </char></note> mugire ogwo mutungi muti: Obusingye bugume ahariiwe, n'aha ka yaawe, n'ahari byona ebi oine. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Mpuriire ku oine abarikukyemura ebyoya; kandi ebi biro tubaire turi hamwe n'abariisa baawe; omwanya gwona ogu baamazire Karumeeli, titwine ki tubaitsize, kandi tibaine kintu kyona eki baafeereirwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Buuza abatsigazi baawe, nibaija kukugambira. Ninkweshengyereza abatsigazi bangye bagirirwe embabazi omu maisho gaawe, ahakuba twaija aha izooba rirungi ry'obugyenyi. N'ahabw'ekyo eki oraabe oine kyona obe nikyo waaha abairu baawe n'omwana waawe Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Abatsigazi ba Daudi ku baahikire aho, baagambira Nabali byona nk'oku Daudi yaabibatuma; baaguma bategyereize. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 123:3">Zab 123:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 123:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Nabali yaagarukamu abo baheereza ba Daudi, ati: Daudi ogwo niwe oha? Kandi mwene Yese niwe oha? Ebi biro hariho abahuuku baingi abacwire ahari bakama baabo. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Mbwenu nyeyakye eby'okurya byangye, n'amaizi gangye, n'enyama ei mbaagiire abakyemuzi bangye b'ebyoya, mbihe abantu abu ntarikumanya i barikuruga? <verse eid="1SA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Batyo abatsigazi ba Daudi baahinduka, baagarukayo, baamuteekyerereza ebyo byona. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:24">1 Sam 30:24</ref>. </char></note> Daudi nikwo kugira abashaija be ati: Buri muntu ahagatire rurara ye. Batyo buri muntu yaahagatira rurara ye, na Daudi yaahagatira eye; abantu nka magana ana bainamuka bakuratiire Daudi; na magana abiri baatsigara aha bintu.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Omwe aha batsigazi ba Nabali yaagambira Abigaili muka mukama we ati: Reeba, Daudi atumire entumwa, zaaruga omu ihamba kuramutsya mukama waitu; ku baizire, yaabajuukirira. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Haza abo bashaija bakatubeera efura; tibaine ki baatwitsize nari eki twafeereirwe, omwanya gwona ogu twamazire nabo turi omu mariisizo. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:5">Zek 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Bakatubeera orugo nyomushana na nyekiro, omwanya gwona ogu twamazire nabo nituriisa entaama. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati okimanye, oteekateekye eki oraakore, ahakuba bamaririire kukora kubi mukama waitu n'eka ye yoona; noomanya omuntu mubi nk'ogwo tihaine orikubaasa kugamba nawe.<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 17:28">2 Sam 17:28</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 17:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:13">Kut 32:13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 21:14">Enf 21:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abigaili yaakoresa obwira, yaagira emigaati magana abiri, n'efurebe ibiri za viinyo, n'enyama y'entaama itaano eteekire gye, n'encuro itaano z'engano ezikarangire, n'emitsitsa igana y'emizaabibu eyomire, kandi n'ebiihuro magana abiri by'ebijuma by'emitiini, yaabita aha ndogoya, <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />yaagira abatsigazi be ati: Muunyebembere; niinyija kubakurata. Kwonka tiyaabigambira iba Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Ku yaabaire ari aha ndogoya naashuuma omu rukiizi rw'ekibungo, reeba Daudi n'abantu be nabo baashuuma nibareebana nawe, baabugaabugana. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:5">Zab 109:5</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:17">1 Pet 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Daudi akaba agizire ati: Buzimazima nkahendekyera busha kurinda ebintu ebi ekyo kishaija kyabaire kiine omu ihamba byona; tihaagira kintu kyona omu bintu byakyo ekyabura; nkamukorera gye, mbwenu yanzimuurira ebibi. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Nyowe Daudi ku ndaahitsye omu kasheeshe hakiriho ekyetwa omwojo omu bantu be boona, Ruhanga akinture n'okukiraho.<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigaili ku yaareebire Daudi, yaarahuka yaaruga aha ndogoya ye, yaajuumara omu maisho ga Daudi, yainama ahansi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Yaamukwata amaguru naagira ati: Mukama wangye, ekyo kibi kibe niinye kyabarirwa. Ninkweshengyereza ikiriza omuzaana waawe agire eki yaakugambira, naiwe ohurire ebigambo by'omuzaana waawe. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Mukama wangye, ninkweshengyereza, reka kweta ahari ogwo mushaija mubi Nabali; ahakuba oku arikwetwa, nikwo arikushusha; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nabali amakuru ngu omushema. </char></note>Nabali niryo iziina rye, n'obushema butuura bumwezingiriire; kwonka nyowe omuzaana waawe tindeebire batsigazi baawe abu otumire, mukama wangye; nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, kandi ninkurahira, timbareebire. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />N'ahabw'ekyo mukama wangye, nk'oku MUKAMA akuzibiire kwehoorera enzigu n'omukono gwawe, okagiibwaho orubanja rw'eshagama, reka abazigu baawe n'abarikukutengyera kubi, mukama wangye, babe nka Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:11">Kut 33:11</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ngugu omutoijo ogu omuzaana waawe yaakureetera, mukama wangye, guheebwe abatsigazi abarikugyendana mukama wangye. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:29">Bir 33:29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:29">Mat 10:29</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:28">Byak 17:28</ref>. </char></note> Ninkweshengyereza saasira omuzaana waawe ekyo kibi, ahakuba MUKAMA taribura kukwombekyera enju ehamire; ahabw'okuba mukama wangye, niiwe orwana engamba za MUKAMA, kandi torireebwaho kibi ebiro byona ebi orimara omu nsi. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:3">1 Sam 28:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'obu abantu baimukire kukuhiiga n'okwenda kukwita, mukama wangye, amagara gaawe garyakomwa hamwe na MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe omu mutwaro gumwe gw'abahuriire; kwonka amagara g'abazigu baawe aryagarekyera nk'eibaare ry'enjungu. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Mbwenu MUKAMA ku ariba yaaherize kuhikiiriza ebirungi byona ebi yaakugambireho, akakugira omugabe wa Israeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />nyetsya eki kitarikusaasa nari okukureetera okwefuuza ahabw'okusheesha eshagama y'abataine rubanja nari okwehoorera enzigu. Kandi MUKAMA ku ariba yaakukoreire ebirungi, Nyakusinga, oijukye omuzaana waawe.<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daudi yaagarukamu Abigaili ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, owaakwohereza kumbugana eri izooba, asiimwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Kandi obwengye bwawe busiimwe, naiwe osiimwe ahabw'okunzibira eri izooba kwehoorera enzigu n'omukono gwangye, nkagiibwaho orubanja. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Ninkurahira MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli owanzibira kukukora kubi, kuri noogira ngu tiwaarahuka kwija kumbugana, bwaba nibuza kusheesha hatakiriho ekyetwa omwojo omu bantu ba Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Atyo Daudi yaayakiira ebi yaamutoijera, yaamugira ati: Yeinamukire owaawe n'obusingye; ebi waagamba naabihurira, n'ebi waashaba naabiikiriza.<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:11">Isa 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:34">Luk 21:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abigaili yaagaruka owa Nabali, yaashanga ateekire obugyenyi omu nju ye, oburikushusha nk'obw'omugabe; kandi agwirwe gye omu mutima, ahabw'okuba akaba asinzire munonga; n'ahabw'ekyo Abigaili tiyaagira ki yaamugambira kyona okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Ku bwaseesire, Nabali amaarwa gaamurugaho, omukazi we yaamuteekyerereza ebyo byona, omutima gwa Nabali gwamuhwa omunda, yaaba nk'ekiti. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:7">2 Sam 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:10">Yob 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:23">Byak 12:23</ref>. </char></note> Ku haahingwireho ebiro ikumi, MUKAMA yaamuteera, yaafa.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 22:23">Enf 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 7:16">Zab 7:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi ku yaahuriire ngu Nabali yaafa, yaagira ati: MUKAMA asiimwe, owaanyihaho ekijumo eki Nabali anjumire, akazibira omwiru we kukora ekibi; kandi MUKAMA azimuuriire Nabali obubi bwe. Bwanyima Daudi yaatuma ahari Abigaili, naamuresya kumutwara, ngu abe omukazi we. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Abagaragwa ba Daudi ku baahikire Karumeeli owa Abigaili, baamugira bati: Daudi yaakututumaho kumukutwarira, ngu obe omukazi we. <verse eid="1SA 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:13">Rus 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Yaabandatuka, yainika omutwe ahansi, yaagira ati: Reeba, nyowe omuzaana we ndi ow'okunaabisa ebigyere by'abagaragwa ba mukama wangye. <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Ahonaaho Abigaili yaimuka, yaatemba endogoya, aine abazaana be bataano bamukuratiire; yaakurata entumwa za Daudi, yaaba omukazi we.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:2">2 Sam 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Daudi yaashwera Ahinoamu owa Yezereeli; bombi baaba abakazi be. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:14">2 Sam 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Saulo akaba yaahingiire Paluti mwene Laishi owa Galimu muhara we Mikaali, owaabaire ari muka Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Saulo okugaruka kuhiiga Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:19">1 Sam 23:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima aba Ziifu baaza Gibea owa Saulo, baamugira bati: Waamanyire Daudi ku ayesherekire omu kibungo kya Hakila aha burugwa-izooba bwa Yeshimooni? <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Ahonaaho Saulo yaimuka, yaashuuma omu ihamba rya Ziifu, aine engabo enkumi ishatu ezitoorainwe omuri Israeli, kuza kusherura Daudi omuri eryo ihamba. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Saulo yaateera orusiisira aha kibungo kya Hakila, ekiri aha rubaju rw'omuhanda aha burugwa-izooba bwa Yeshimooni. Kwonka Daudi yaaguma omu ihamba; ku yaareebire Saulo aizire omu ihamba kumusherura, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />yaatuma entatsi, zaahamiza kimwe Saulo ku aizire. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:50">1 Sam 14:50</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaimuka, yaija omu mwanya ogu Saulo ateiremu orusiisira; yaayetegyereza ahu Saulo abyami hamwe na Abuneeri mwene Neeri, omukuru w'engabo z'eihe rye; kandi Saulo akaba abyami omu mwanya gw'ahagati y'ebigaari, abantu bateire orusiisira bamwehinguririize.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 2:16">1 Bus 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi yaagambira Ahimeleki Omuhiiti na Abishai murumuna wa Yoabu mwene Zeruiya, ati: N'oha orikwija kushuuma naanye omu rusiisira ahu Saulo ari? Abishai yaagira ati: Niinye ndaashuumeyo naiwe. <verse eid="1SA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Daudi na Abishai baahika omuri ezo ngabo nyekiro omu rusiisira, baahika ahu Saulo yaabaire abyami agwejegyeire, omu mwanya gw'ahagati y'ebigaari, eicumu rye ritsimbire aha mushego, Abuneeri n'engabo ze babyami bamwehinguririize. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:4">1 Sam 24:4</ref>. </char></note> Abishai yaagira Daudi ati: Eri izooba Ruhanga yaahayo omuzigu waawe omu mikono yaawe; mbwenu reka mmuteere eicumu rimwe, rimwogyemu, rikwate omu itaka, tindikwija kumuteera rya kabiri. <verse eid="1SA 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Kwonka Daudi yaagira Abishai ati: Reka, otamwita; mbwenu n'oha orikubaasa kubangira omukono ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta, atagiibweho rubanja? <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:38">1 Sam 25:38</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:23">Zab 94:23</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:22">Enf 20:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:7">Luk 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:30">Heb 10:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:35">Bir 32:35</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagaruka yaagira ati: Ninkurahira MUKAMA otahwaho, MUKAMA niwe arimweyitira; nari shi obunaku bwe ku burihika, aryafa; nari aryashuuma omu rugamba, agweyo. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:29">Enf 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:9">1 Pet 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Rubuuza; nyowe okubanga omukono gwangye aha muntu ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta; kureka iha eicumu n'orunywero rw'amaizi aha mushego gwe, tugyende. <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:21">Kut 2:21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:12">15:12</ref>; <ref loc="EST 6:1">Est 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Daudi yaiha eicumu n'orunywero rw'amaizi aha mushego gwa Saulo, baagyenda. Tihaagira owaakireeba, nari owaakimanya, n'obu yaakuba owaasisiimuka, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akaba abagwejegyeize obutasisiimuka.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Bwanyima Daudi yaayambuka seeri, yaayemerera hare aha mutwe gw'ekibungo, ahagati yaabo haaba kaanya. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Daudi yaayeta engabo na Abuneeri mwene Neeri, naagira ati: Abuneeri, ku otarikuteeza? Abuneeri yaamugarukamu ati: Iwe orikweta omugabe ori oha? <verse eid="1SA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi yaagira Abuneeri ati: Tori emanzi? N'oha orikwingana naiwe omuri Israeli? Mbwenu ekikuzibiire kurinda mukama waawe omugabe n'enki? Ahakuba omuntu aizire omuriimwe kwita omugabe mukama waawe. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Eki okozire ti kirungi. Ninkurahira MUKAMA otahwaho, mushemereire kufa, ahabw'okuba timurinzire gye mukama waanyu, ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta. Mbwenu reeba eicumu ry'omugabe n'orunywero rw'amaizi orubaire ruri aha mushego gwe.<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Saulo yaamanya eiraka rya Daudi, yaagira ati: Beitu eryo iraka n'eryawe, mwana wangye Daudi? Daudi yaagira ati: N'eryangye, mukama wangye omugabe. <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:9">1 Sam 24:9</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 24:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Beitu shi, mukama wangye ahiigira ki omwiru we? Nkakora ki? Nari shi ni kibi ki eki nyine? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:16">2 Sam 14:16</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, Nyakusinga omugabe, hurira ebigambo by'omwiru waawe. MUKAMA ku araabe niwe anteeraine naiwe, aikirize empongano; kwonka ku baraabe bari abantu, bakyeenwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA, ahakuba eri izooba bambinga ngu ntagira omugabo omu buhunguzi bwa MUKAMA, nibagira bati: Irooko oheereze baaruhanga abandi. <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati otaikiriza eshagama yangye kugwa ahansi, ahu MUKAMA atari; ahabw'okuba omugabe wa Israeli aizire kusherura omura, nk'ohiigire endahi omu bibungo.<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:27">Kur 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:34">Kub 22:34</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:14">1 Sam 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 24:17">24:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:4">Mat 27:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo yaagira ati: Nkashiisha; garuka, mwana wangye Daudi. Tindigaruka kukukora kubi, ahakuba amagara gangye gaaba ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gaawe eri izooba. Reeba, nkakora eby'obufa-mutima, naahaba munonga. <verse eid="1SA 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi yaamugira ati: Reeba eicumu ryawe ndiri, Nyakusinga! Hagire omwe aha batsigazi baawe, aije aryakiire. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:20">Zab 18:20</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA azimuurira omuntu nk'okuhikiirira kwe n'obwesigwa bwe oku biri. Omanye ku MUKAMA yaakuhayo omu mikono yangye eri izooba, nkanga kubanga omukono gwangye ahariiwe ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Kandi nk'oku amagara gaawe gaaba ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gangye eri izooba, n'agangye gabe nikwo gaaba ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, anjune omu kutuntuzibwa kwona. <verse eid="1SA 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Kut 32:28</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Saulo yaagira Daudi ati: Oheebwe omugisha, mwana wangye Daudi; oryakora bikuru, kandi n'okusingura oryasingura. Atyo Daudi yaayegyendera, Saulo nawe yaagaruka owe.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okuhungira omu Bafilistia n'okuheebwa orurembo rw'okutuuramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Bwanyima Daudi yaagira omu mutima gwe ati: Hoona eizooba rimwe Saulo aryarugaho anyite; tihariho kirikunkirira okuhungira omu nsi y'Abafilistia, kikaareetera Saulo kumpwa amatsiko, akareka kugaruka kunsherurira omu byaro bya Israeli byona; nkamukira ntyo. <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:10">1 Sam 21:10</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaimuka n'abashaija be magana mukaaga abu yaabaire aine, baayambuka, baayehongyera Akishi mwene Maoki, omugabe wa Gaasi. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi n'abashaija be baatuura na Akishi omuri Gaasi, buri muntu n'ab'omu ka ye, na Daudi n'abakazi be bombi, Ahinoamu owa Yezereeli, na Abigaili owa Karumeeli, owaabaire ari muka Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Abantu baagambira Saulo ku Daudi ahungiire Gaasi; tiyaagaruka kumusherura bundi.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Bwanyima Daudi yaagira Akishi ati: Ku ndaabe ngiriirwe embabazi omu maisho gaawe, bampe ekibanja omu rurembo rumwe aha ndembo z'omu byaro, mbe nimwo naatuura; mbwenu omwiru waawe atuuzibwe ki naiwe omu rurembo rw'omugabe? <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Atyo Akishi yaamuha orurembo Zikulaagi eryo izooba; nikyo Zikulaagi yaabeereire ey'abagabe ba Yuda okwiha obwo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Ebiro ebi Daudi yaamazire omu nsi y'Abafilistia bikahika omwaka n'ameezi ana.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Bwanyima Daudi n'abashaija be bainamuka, baateera aba Geshuri n'aba Giruzi n'Abaamaleki; ahakuba ago mahanga ira nigo gaabaire gatwire omuri egyo nsi erikugarukira Shuuri n'aha mwatano gw'ensi ya Misri. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Daudi yaacwekyereza egyo nsi, tihaarokokamu mushaija nari omukazi; yaanyaga entaama n'ente n'endogoya n'engamira kandi n'ebijwaro; bwanyima yaatabaaruka, yaaza owa Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 141:3">Zab 141:3</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 29:25">Enf 29:25</ref>. </char></note> Akishi akaba amubuuza ati: Eri izooba waateera hi? Daudi amugarukamu ati: Naateera Negebu eya Yuda, nari Negebu ey'aba Yerameeli, nari ey'aba Keeni. <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Kwonka Daudi akaba atarokora mushaija nari omukazi, ngu abatware Gaasi; ahabw'okuba akaba agira ngu nibaija kubarega bati: Daudi atukozire ati n'ati. Kandi ebiro byona ebi yaamazire omu nsi y'Abafilistia nikwo yaabaire atwaza. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo Akishi akeesiga Daudi, yaaguma naagira ati: Ayetamiise munonga beene waabo Abaisraeli; n'ahabw'ekyo naija kuguma ari omugaragwa wangye ebiro byona.<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 29:1">1 Sam 29:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Abafilistia bakahuruza engabo zaabo, baaziteerana kuza kurwana n'Abaisraeli. Akishi yaagira Daudi ati: Omanyire kimwe iwe n'abashaija baawe ku murikwija kuhurura naanye omu ihe ryaitu. <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:9">Rom 12:9</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaamugira ati: Eego, aho niho oraamanyire eki omwiru waawe arikubaasa kukora. Akishi yaagira Daudi ati: Eego, naanye niinyija kukugira omurinzi w'amagara gangye ebiro byona.<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saulo okuraguza aha mukazi orikubandwa emizimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:18">Kur 22:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo Samueli akaba amazire omwanya afiire; kandi omu kufa kwe Abaisraeli boona bakamucurira, baamuziika omu rurembo rwe Raama. Kandi Saulo akaba aherize kucwa abarikugambisa emizimu n'abarogi omu nsi ye. <verse eid="1SA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Omu biro ebyo Abafilistia bakateerana, baaza Shuneemu, baateerayo orusiisira. Saulo nawe yaateerana Abaisraeli boona, baateera orusiisira Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 18:11">Yob 18:11</ref>. </char></note> Saulo ku yaareebire eihe ry'Abafilistia, yaatiina, omutima gwamuhwa omunda, yaatetema munonga. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:37">1 Sam 14:37</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:28">Enf 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 28:30">Kur 28:30</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaayehanwize ahari MUKAMA, MUKAMA tiyaagira ki yaamugarukamu, yaaba mu birooto nari omuri Urimu, n'obu haakuba omuri baanabi. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Saulo nikwo kugira abagaragwa be ati: Munsherurire omugirwakazi w'emizimu, nze kumuraguzaho. Abagaragwa be baamugarukamu bati: Reeba, hariho omurogikazi ari Endoori.<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 10:13">1 Bus 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:19">Isa 8:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saulo yaayehindura, yaajwara ebindi bijwaro, yaagyenda n'abashaija babiri, baaza ow'ogwo mukazi nyekiro, yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ndagurira n'omuzimu ogu obandwa, ondeetere ou ndaakugambire. <verse eid="1SA 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Ogwo mukazi yaamugira ati: Noomanyira kimwe eki Saulo yaakozire, ku yaacwire abarikubandwa emizimu n'abarogi omu nsi ye. Mbwenu ahabw'enki nootega amagara gangye omutego ngu baanyite? <verse eid="1SA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Saulo yaamurahira MUKAMA naagira ati: Ninkurahira MUKAMA atahwaho, ekyo torikiturwa. <verse eid="1SA 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Omukazi yaamubuuza ati: Nkuzoorere oha? Onu ati: Nzoorera Samueli. <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Ogwo mukazi ku yaareebire Samueli, yaayamuza n'eiraka rihango; yaagira Saulo ati: Wambeihera ki? Kunu ori Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kur 22:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 138:1">Zab 138:1</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaamugira ati: Otatiina! Ngambira eki orikureeba. Omukazi yaagira Saulo ati: Nindeeba ruhanga naaruga okuzimu. <verse eid="1SA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Yaamubuuza ati: Naashusha ki? Onu ati: N'omugurusi orikwinamuka, kandi ayehumbikire omwenda. Saulo yaamanya ku ari Samueli, yainama, yaamutangirira.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 18:12">1 Sam 18:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Samueli yaabuuza Saulo ati: Ahabw'enki waanyomberera, okarugaho okanyiha okuzimu? Saulo yaagarukamu ati: Nshobeirwe munonga; ahabw'okuba Abafilistia nibandwanisa, kandi Ruhanga andugireho; takingarukiramu muri baanabi nari omu birooto. Nikyo naakwetera, ngu ommanyise eki ndaakore. <verse eid="1SA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samueli yaagira ati: Ku oraabe noomanya ngu MUKAMA akurugireho, yaahinduka omuzigu waawe, nombuuriza ki? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1 Sam 15:28</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akugizire nk'oku yaagambire naaraba omuriinye, ahakuba MUKAMA akakutaaguraho obugabe, yaabuha mutaahi waawe Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:9">1 Sam 15:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 20:42">1 Bag 20:42</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:10">Yer 48:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okutoorobera iraka rya MUKAMA, n'okutahikiiriza kiniga kye kingi aha Baamaleki, nikyo MUKAMA yaakugirira atyo eri izooba. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />N'ekindi MUKAMA naija kukuhayo hamwe n'Abaisraeli omu mikono y'Abafilistia, kandi nyencakare iwe n'abatabani baawe nimwija kunshanga ei ndi. MUKAMA naija kuhayo eihe ry'Abaisraeli omu mikono y'Abafilistia.<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Ahonaaho Saulo yaagwa ahansi arambiire, aine obwoba bwingi ahabw'ebigambo bya Samueli; amaani gaamuhwamu, ahabw'okuba akaba asiibirekwo kandi arairekwo. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Bwanyima ogwo mukazi yaija ahari Saulo; ku yaareebire atiinire munonga, yaamugira ati: Reeba, nyowe omuzaana waawe naakuhurira, naayoga amagara, naakora eki wandagiira. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, naiwe ohurire omuzaana waawe, onyikirize nkureetere ak'okurya, orye, obone agagyenda. <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Yaayanga, yaagira ati: Tindikwija kurya. Kwonka abagaragwa be hamwe n'ogwo mukazi baamugyema, yaikiriza ebi baamugambira. Yaabandatuka ahansi, yaashutama aha kitanda. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ogwo mukazi akaba aine enyana y'ebishaju omu nju; yaakoresa obwira, yaagiita, yaagira esaano, yaagibumbabumba, yaagiteekamu omugaati ogutatumbisiibwe; <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />yaabireetera Saulo n'abagaragwa be, baarya. Bwanyima baimuka ekyo kiro, baagyenda.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Abafilistia okwetomboitera Akishi ahabwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 4:1">1 Sam 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abafilistia baateeranira engabo zaabo zoona Afeki; n'Abaisraeli baateera orusiisira rwabo Yezereeli haihi n'enshuro yaaho. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:1">1 Sam 28:1</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 28:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Abategyeki b'Abafilistia baahurura bari omu mitwe ya igana-igana n'eya rukumi-rukumi; kandi Daudi n'abashaija be hamwe na Akishi baabaija enyima. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Ku baabaire nibakigyenda, abakuru b'engabo z'Abafilistia baagira bati: Beitu shi, aba Baheburaayo nibakora ki aha? Akishi yaabagarukamu ati: Ogu ti Daudi, omugaragwa wa Saulo omugabe wa Israeli, omazire naanye ebiro n'emyaka? Okwiha obu yaanyehongyera n'okuhitsya hati tinkamureebahoga kishobyo kyona. <verse eid="1SA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:21">1 Sam 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 12:19">1 Bus 12:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abakuru b'Abafilistia baamugwerwa kubi, baamugira bati: Garurayo omuntu ogu, agarukye omu kibanja kye eki waamuhaire, otamwikiriza kushuuma naitwe aha rugamba, atakaahika omu rugamba, akatuhindukana, akaba omuzigu waitu. Noogira ngu ogu mushaija akaagarukaine ata na mukama we, yaaba atatwaire mitwe yaitu? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1 Sam 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:11">21:11</ref>. </char></note> Ogu ti Daudi, ou baayeshongoire omu kuzina kwabo nibaikirizana bati: Saulo aitsire enkumi, Daudi yaita obukumi?<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Akishi nikwo kweta Daudi akamugira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, niiwe ohikire; ahabwangye nindeeba ngu oshemereire kuhurura n'okutabaaruka naanye omu ihe ryaitu, ahakuba okwiha obu waanyehongyera n'okuhitsya hati, tinkakureebahoga kishobyo; kwonka abategyeki tibarikukwenda. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo yegarukireyo, ogyende n'obusingye, orekye kugwisa kubi abategyeki b'Abafilistia. <verse eid="1SA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daudi yaagira Akishi ati: Beitu shi, ncumwire ki? Okwiha obu naakwehongyera n'okuhitsya hati n'enki eki orareebire aha mwiru waawe, ekyakunzibira kuza kurwanisa abazigu ba mukama wangye omugabe? <verse eid="1SA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi yaamugarukamu ati: Nimmanya ku otaine ky'okuhanwa omu maisho gangye nka maraika wa Ruhanga; kwonka abakuru b'Abafilistia baagira bati: Tarikwija kuhurura naitwe. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo ogurukye kare omu kasheeshe n'abairu ba mukama waawe abu oizire nabo; ku muraimukye muti omu kasheeshe, haija nihahweza, mugyende. <verse eid="1SA 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:9">Enf 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:21">Isa 30:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:23">Yer 10:23</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Daudi yaimuka kare n'abashaija be, baimutsya orugyendo kugaruka omu nsi y'Abafilistia; n'Abafilistia bainamuka, baahika Yezereeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Abaamaleki okwotsya Zikulaagi, na Daudi okugarura eminyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:8-16">Kur 17:8-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 25:17">Bir 25:17</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 25:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:18">1 Sam 28:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 4:43">1 Bus 4:43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi n'abashaija be baahika Zikulaagi aha kiro kya kashatu, baashanga Abaamaleki baateire Negebu na Zikulaagi; baasingwire Zikulaagi, kandi baagyokize; <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 76:10">Zab 76:10</ref>. </char></note> baanyagire abakazi n'abaabaire bagitwiremu boona, abato n'abakuru; bataine u baitsire, kureka babatwaire, beegyendeire. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daudi n'abashaija be ku baahikire omuri orwo rurembo, baashanga barwokize, kandi abakazi baabo n'abatabani baabo na bahara baabo banyagirwe. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Ahonaaho Daudi n'abu yaabaire aine, baimutsya amaraka gaabo, baaborooga, okuhitsya obu baahikire ahu batakibaasiza kuborooga. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Kandi abakazi ba Daudi bombi, Ahinoamu owa Yezereeli na Abigaili owaabaire ari muka Nabali owa Karumeeli, nabo bakaba banyagirwe. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:4">Kur 17:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:59">Yoh 8:59</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:20">Rom 4:20</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaashaasha munonga, ahabw'okuba abantu bakaba nibagira ngu bamuteere amabaare; ahakuba abantu boona bakaba baine obushaarizi omu mutima, buri muntu naasaasibwa batabani be na bahara be; kwonka Daudi yaayehamiza omuri MUKAMA Ruhanga we.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:6">1 Sam 23:6</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 23:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaagira Abiasaari omunyamurwa, mwene Ahimeleki, ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ndeetera efodi. Atyo Abiasaari yaagimureetera. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:2">1 Sam 23:2</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 23:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaayehanuuza ahari MUKAMA ati: Ku ndaakurate ezo ngabo, niinyija kuzihika? MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati: Zikurate; ahakuba torikwija kubura kuzihika, kandi torikwija kuremwa kugarura ebintu byona. <verse eid="1SA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Atyo Daudi yaagyenda n'abashaija magana mukaaga abu yaabaire aine; ku baahikire aha kagyera Besori, abaabaire bari enyima baatsigara aho. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Kwonka Daudi yaagumizamu n'abashaija magana ana; ahakuba abaatsigaire enyima baruhire, batakiine gambuka, bakaba bari magana abiri.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Bwanyima baashanga Omunyamisri omu ishwa, baamureetera Daudi, baamuha omugaati, yaarya; baamuha n'amaizi g'okunywa; <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />kandi baamuha omwate gumwe aha kiihuro ky'ebijuma by'emitiini n'emitsitsa ebiri y'emizaabibu eyomire. Ku yaaherize kurya, yaagarukwamu amaani; ahabw'okuba akaba amazire ebiro bishatu atarikurya n'obu kwakuba okunywa, nyomushana na nyekiro. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daudi yaamubuuza ati: Ori ow'oha? Kandi nooruga hi? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ndi omutsigazi Omunyamisri, omuhuuku w'Omuamaleki; mukama wangye antsigireho, ahakuba ebiro bishatu ebihingwire mbaire ndwaire. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:13">Yos 14:13</ref>. </char></note> Tukaba tuteire Negebu ey'Abakeresi n'ey'Abayuda, n'eya Kalebu, twayotsya Zikulaagi. <verse eid="1SA 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi yaamubuuza ati: Okaanyebembera, ompitsya omuri ezo ngabo? Onu ati: Ndahira Ruhanga ku otarikwija kuunyita, n'obu kwakuba okumpayo omu mikono ya mukama wangye, mbone kuzikuhitsyamu.<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:19">Luk 12:19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:34">21:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaamuhikizeyo, baashanga bajanjaire aho hoona, nibarya nibanywa nibazina, ahabw'eminyago egyo yoona emingi ei banyagire omu nsi y'Abafilistia n'omu nsi ya Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:5">Yob 20:5</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaabaita okwiha omu rwita-waabo okuhitsya omu mwabazyo gw'erindi izooba; tihaahonokaho n'omwe omuribo, kureka abatsigazi magana ana, abaatembire engamira bakahunga. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:16">Kut 14:16</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagarura ebi Abaamaleki babaire banyagire byona; kandi yaajuna abakazi be bombi. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Tihaagira kintu kyona ekyabura, yaaba kihango nari kikye, yaaba boojo nari abaishiki, yaaba munyago nari ekindi kintu kyona ekibaire kitwairwe; Daudi yaabigarura byona. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Kandi Daudi yaanyaga amasyo goona ag'entaama n'ag'ente; abantu baagafunya bageebembeize Daudi, nibagira bati: Ogu n'omunyago gwa Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Bwanyima Daudi yaahika aha bashaija bari magana abiri, abaruhire bakabura agamukurata, bakabatsiga aha kagyera Besori; baaza kubugana Daudi n'abantu abu abaire aine. Daudi ku yaabahika, yaabaramutsya. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:13">Bir 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 19:22">Bar 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 22:2">1 Sam 22:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abantu babi boona abataine buntu, omuri abo abahurwire na Daudi, baagira bati: Titurikwija kubaha aha minyago ei tugarwire, ahakuba tibahurwire naitwe, kureka buri muntu tumuhe omukazi we n'abaana be, babatware, bagyende. <verse eid="1SA 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Kwonka Daudi yaagira ati: Beene waitu, tikwo murikwija kutwaza ebi MUKAMA atuhaire, MUKAMA oturinzire, akahayo omu mikono yaitu ezo ngabo ezibaire zituteire. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:27">Kub 31:27</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:8">Yos 22:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:12">Zab 68:12</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu hariho orikwija kwikiriza ekyo eki murikugamba? Ahakuba omugabo gw'ogiire aha rugamba nikyo kimwe n'ogw'otsigaire aha bintu; boona nibaija kubagana, bainganise. <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Okwiha ahari eryo izooba yaakihindura ekiragiro n'omugyenzo omuri Israeli n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daudi ku yaahikire Zikulaagi, yaatwekyera banywani be abakuru b'Abayuda ahari egyo minyago, naagira ati: Ekiconco kyanyu nkikyo, ekirugire aha minyago y'abazigu ba MUKAMA; <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />yaabitwekyera abaabaire bari Beseeli, na Ramoosi omuri Negebu, na Yatiri, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />na Aroeri, na Sifumoosi, na Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 27:10">1 Sam 27:10</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 1:16">Bar 1:16</ref>. </char></note> na Rakali, n'ab'omu ndembo z'aba Yerameeli n'ez'aba Keeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />n'ab'omuri Horuma, na Korashaani, na Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na Heburooni n'emyanya yoona ei Daudi n'abantu be baabaire bazengyereramu.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Saulo na Yonasaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 10:1">1 Bus 10:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abafilistia baarwana n'Abaisraeli, Abaisraeli baabahunga, kwonka baitirwa aha kibungo kya Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Abafilistia baahambya Saulo n'abatabani, baita Yonasaani na Abinadabu na Malikishua, beene Saulo. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:6">2 Sam 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Orugamba rwaba orw'amaani ahari Saulo, abarasi baamugwaho, baamuhutaaza munonga. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:54">Bar 9:54</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 14:6">1 Sam 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 1:10">2 Sam 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Saulo nikwo kugira omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye, ati: Ihayo rurara yaawe, oginteere, abatashazirwe bariya batakaija, bakancumita, bakanshungisa. Kwonka omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye yaayanga, ahabw'okuba akatiina munonga. Nikyo Saulo yaasyoreireyo rurara ye, akagyetungaho. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Ogwo mukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye, ku yaareebire yaafa, nawe yaayetunga aha ye, baafa kumwe. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:25">1 Sam 12:25</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 10:6">1 Bus 10:6</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Saulo yaafiire n'abatabani bonshatu, n'omukwatsi w'eby'okurwanisa bye, n'engabo ze zoona; bakafeera hamwe eryo izooba. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Kandi Abaisraeli abaabaire bari seeri y'oruhita, n'abaabaire bari seeri ya Yorudani, ku baareebire Abaisraeli baahunga, na Saulo n'abatabani baafa, baatsigaho endembo zaabo, baahunga; Abafilistia baija, baazituuramu.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Ku bwaseesire, Abafilistia baija kucwijura emitumbi, baashanga Saulo n'abatabani bonshatu bagwire aha kibungo kya Giliboa, <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />baamutemaho omutwe, baamucwijura eby'okurwanisa bye, baatuma entumwa omu nsi y'Abafilistia kubuzya hoona amakuru omuri hekalu z'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, n'omu bantu boona. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Eby'okurwanisa bye baabita omuri hekalu ya Ashitaroosi, n'omutumbi gwe baaguhanika aha rugo rw'amabaare rwa Besi-shaani. <verse eid="1SA 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Abanyayabeshi-gileadi ku baahuriire oku Abafilistia bagizire Saulo, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:1-11">1 Sam 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 2:4-7">2 Sam 2:4-7</ref>. </char></note> abashaija boona amamanzi baimuka, baagyenda ekiro kyona, baahanura omutumbi gwa Saulo n'ey'abatabani aha rugo rwa Besi-shaani, baagaruka Yabeshi; ku baahikireyo, baagyotsya. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:12-14">2 Sam 21:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:13">Yob 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baatwara amagufa gaabo, baagaziika ahansi y'omunyinya ogw'omuri Yabeshi, baamara ebiro mushanju nibeesiibyakwo.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>